and product teams"},"171":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-32","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare","content":"How Create with AI compares"},"172":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-33","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare-stronger","content":"Why EasyWebinar is the stronger choice for Create with AI"},"173":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-34","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"174":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-35","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"175":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-36","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-how-long","content":"How long does Create with AI take?"},"176":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-37","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-credits","content":"How many credits does it use?"},"177":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-38","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-some-parts","content":"Can I generate only some parts?"},"178":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-39","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-edit","content":"Can I edit what the AI produced?"},"179":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-40","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-regenerate-script","content":"Can I regenerate just the script?"},"180":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-41","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-types","content":"Does it work for simulive and evergreen webinars?"},"181":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-42","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-present-script","content":"Can I present from the script?"},"182":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-43","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-ai-badge","content":"How do I tell which webinars were built with AI?"},"183":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-44","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-good-prompt","content":"What makes a good prompt?"},"184":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-45","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-offer-positioning","content":"How hard will the generated offer sell?"},"185":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-46","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#related","content":"Related"},"186":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-47","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","content":"**Create with AI** builds a complete EasyWebinar webinar from a written description. In five steps it writes a slide-by-slide presentation script, fills your registration, thank-you and waiting-area pages, drafts the email sequence, and creates polls and offers. A full build takes about 10 to 15 minutes and uses around 23 credits, and everything it produces opens in the normal editors so you can change it."},"187":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-48","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                                                                                            |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where to start** | **Create with AI** in the sidebar, or **Create with AI** instead of **Create Manually** in the **Create a Webinar** dialog |","table":"table-0"},"188":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-49","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                                     |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it builds** | **Script**, **Landing pages**, **Emails**, **Polls** and **Offers** |","table":"table-0"},"189":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-50","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#at-a-glance","content":"|                         |                                                                           |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Selected by default** | Script, Landing pages and Emails. Polls and Offers are added with a click |","table":"table-0"},"190":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-51","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                                   |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar types** | **Live**, **Simulive** or **Evergreen**, chosen with **Type** before you generate |","table":"table-0"},"191":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-52","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                                                 |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How long it takes** | About 10 to 15 minutes end to end; the script takes roughly a minute and a half |","table":"table-0"},"192":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-53","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#at-a-glance","content":"|             |                                                                             |\n| ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Credits** | About 23 for a full build: script 10, pages 10, emails 1, polls 1, offers 1 |","table":"table-0"},"193":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-54","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                      |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Your balance** | Shown at the top right of every step |","table":"table-0"},"194":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-55","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                      |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Script output** | Named sections with timings and speaker notes, downloadable as a PDF |","table":"table-0"},"195":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-56","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                                                                                   |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Afterwards** | The webinar carries an **AI** badge in **My Webinars** and behaves like any other |","table":"table-0"},"196":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-57","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#what-it-is","content":"Building a webinar by hand means writing a presentation, designing a registration page, writing a confirmation, reminders and follow-ups, and thinking up polls and an offer. Create with AI does a first draft of all of that from one prompt."},"197":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-58","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#what-it-is","content":"It works in sequence, one step after another. Your prompt becomes a script, and the AI then uses that script as source material when it writes your pages. That ordering matters: the script is the foundation, so getting it right first improves everything built after it."},"198":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-59","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#what-it-is","content":"The result is a normal EasyWebinar webinar. It has the same nine tabs and the same settings as one built by hand. The one visible difference is the **AI** badge on its card in **My Webinars**."},"199":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-60","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#what-its-for","content":"Create with AI is for getting from an idea to a webinar funnel you can run, without starting each piece from a blank page. It suits a first webinar, a new topic, or a team that needs a launch-ready draft quickly."},"200":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-61","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#how-it-helps","content":"**One prompt, five deliverables.** Script, pages, emails, polls and offers all start from the same description."},"201":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-62","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#how-it-helps","content":"**The script is presentation-ready.** It comes in named sections, each with a timing and speaker notes, and downloads as a PDF."},"202":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-63","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#how-it-helps","content":"**Emails arrive wired up.** Merge tags are already in place, so dates, times and join links fill themselves in."},"203":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-64","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#how-it-helps","content":"**Polls have a purpose.** You choose what the polls should achieve. Each one explains why it's there and where it fits."},"204":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-65","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#how-it-helps","content":"**Offers match your pitch.** You choose how hard to sell, and each offer comes back with a headline, button and link."},"205":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-66","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#without-it","content":"Without it, the setup work is spread across several blank pages: a script document, a page builder, five or six emails and an offer. That's often where webinars stall, especially a first one. Pieces written on different days also tend not to match each other."},"206":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-67","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#why-buyers-care","content":"Create with AI matters most to coaches, course creators and small teams who run their own marketing. It matters in the week before a first webinar, when the setup hours are the main thing standing between an idea and a date."},"207":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-68","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#approach","content":"Take a typical case. A solo marketing consultant who helps local accountancy firms win clients plans her first webinar. It's a 40-minute live session on getting referrals through LinkedIn, two weeks away. She has about 400 contacts and wants to end with an invitation to her three-month advisory programme."},"208":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-69","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#approach","content":"A common workaround is to build each piece in a different tool: slides in one, a landing page in another, emails from a template. That can take several evenings. The pieces may drift apart as they're written, and a first webinar can slip while the setup drags on."},"209":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-70","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#approach","content":"The pieces don't really need separate starting points. The script, the page, the emails, the polls and the offer all come from the same idea. If that idea is written down once, each piece can be drafted from it, and her time goes into editing instead."},"210":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-71","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#approach","content":"EasyWebinar turns her description into a complete webinar through **Create with AI**. She sets **Type** to **Live**, adds the **Polls** and **Offers** chips and clicks **Generate**. The script comes first, and the pages are written from it. She chooses **Balanced Approach** for the offer and downloads the script as a PDF to rehearse."},"211":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-72","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#approach","content":"The screenshot under Describe your webinar shows the prompt box, **Type**, the five output chips and the credit balance on one screen. How other platforms use AI to build a webinar is covered in How Create with AI compares, below."},"212":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-73","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#before-you-begin","content":"**Check your credits.** AI generation uses credits, and your balance is shown at the top right of every step. A full build costs around 23."},"213":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-74","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#before-you-begin","content":"**Know your audience and offer.** The prompt drives everything. Have a specific audience, three or four teaching points, a length, a tone, and what you'll sell at the end ready before you start."},"214":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-75","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#before-you-begin","content":"**Decide the webinar type.** Choose **Live**, **Simulive** or **Evergreen** before generating. A webinar's type can't be changed after it's created."},"215":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-76","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#describe-it","content":"Click **Create with AI** in the sidebar."},"216":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-77","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#describe-it","content":"|     | Control        | What it does                  |\n| --- | -------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Prompt box** | Describe the webinar you want |","table":"table-1"},"217":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-78","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#describe-it","content":"|     | Control  | What it does                |\n| --- | -------- | --------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Type** | Live, Simulive or Evergreen |","table":"table-1"},"218":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-79","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#describe-it","content":"|     | Control          | What it does                                 |\n| --- | ---------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Output chips** | Script, Landing pages, Emails, Polls, Offers |","table":"table-1"},"219":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-80","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#describe-it","content":"|     | Control      | What it does     |\n| --- | ------------ | ---------------- |\n| 4   | **Generate** | Starts the build |","table":"table-1"},"220":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-81","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#describe-it","content":"|     | Control     | What it does           |\n| --- | ----------- | ---------------------- |\n| 5   | **Credits** | Your remaining balance |","table":"table-1"},"221":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-82","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#describe-it","content":"Script, Landing pages and Emails are on by default. Click **Polls** and **Offers** to include them. Turn off any chip you don't want generated."},"222":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-83","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#write-a-good-prompt","content":"Output quality depends on the prompt more than anything else. A vague prompt produces a generic webinar. Include:"},"223":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-84","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#write-a-good-prompt","content":"**Who it's for, specifically.** \"Experienced freelance designers stuck at capacity\", not \"designers\"."},"224":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-85","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#write-a-good-prompt","content":"**What it covers.** The three or four things you'll actually teach."},"225":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-86","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#write-a-good-prompt","content":"**How long it runs.**"},"226":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-87","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#write-a-good-prompt","content":"**The tone you want.**"},"227":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-88","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#write-a-good-prompt","content":"**What you're selling at the end,** and the price."},"228":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-89","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#write-a-good-prompt","content":"For example: a 45-minute live masterclass for experienced freelance designers who want recurring revenue without hiring, covering why hourly billing caps growth, how to turn a repeatable service into a fixed-scope offer, and how to price it. Warm and practical, no hype. End with an offer for a six-week group programme with templates and weekly calls, plus its price."},"229":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-90","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#write-a-good-prompt","content":"Click **Generate**."},"230":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-91","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#review-the-script","content":"You're asked for the number of **slides** and the **duration**, then the script is written slide by slide."},"231":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-92","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#review-the-script","content":"| Control           | What it does                |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Webinar topic** | Your prompt, still editable |","table":"table-2"},"232":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-93","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#review-the-script","content":"| Control                 | What it does                 |\n| ----------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **Slides and duration** | Change either and regenerate |","table":"table-2"},"233":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-94","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#review-the-script","content":"| Control        | What it does          |\n| -------------- | --------------------- |\n| **Regenerate** | Writes a fresh script |","table":"table-2"},"234":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-95","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#review-the-script","content":"| Control          | What it does                     |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Download PDF** | Saves the script to present from |","table":"table-2"},"235":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-96","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#review-the-script","content":"The script is organised into named sections, such as the hook and welcome and the problem framing, each with its own timing and speaker notes. Read it before you continue. Fixing the script now is much easier than fixing the pages and emails built from it. Click **Continue to landing pages**."},"236":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-97","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-pages","content":"Choose **AI picks for you** to have a template selected automatically, or **Choose manually** to browse templates yourself."},"237":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-98","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-pages","content":"The AI writes your registration page, thank-you page and waiting area, using the script as source material: headline, what attendees will learn, an instructor bio and the rest. The pages open in an editor with **Edit**, **Preview**, **SEO** and **Scripts** tabs and a desktop and mobile view. Treat them as a strong first draft. Click **Continue**."},"238":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-99","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-emails","content":"The AI drafts a full sequence:"},"239":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-100","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-emails","content":"| Email             | When it sends   |\n| ----------------- | --------------- |\n| **Welcome email** | On registration |","table":"table-3"},"240":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-101","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-emails","content":"| Email             | When it sends |\n| ----------------- | ------------- |\n| **Reminder — 1d** | A day before  |","table":"table-3"},"241":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-102","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-emails","content":"| Email             | When it sends  |\n| ----------------- | -------------- |\n| **Reminder — 1h** | An hour before |","table":"table-3"},"242":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-103","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-emails","content":"| Email              | When it sends          |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------- |\n| **Reminder — 15m** | Fifteen minutes before |","table":"table-3"},"243":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-104","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-emails","content":"| Email                   | When it sends                |\n| ----------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **Follow-up — Instant** | Right after the webinar ends |","table":"table-3"},"244":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-105","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-emails","content":"| Email              | When it sends    |\n| ------------------ | ---------------- |\n| **Follow-up — 1d** | A day afterwards |","table":"table-3"},"245":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-106","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-emails","content":"Merge tags are already in place, so dates, times and join links fill in automatically. **Add email** adds another. Click **Continue**."},"246":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-107","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-polls","content":"Instead of asking what questions you want, this step asks what the polls are for. Choose any combination of goals:"},"247":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-108","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-polls","content":"increasing engagement"},"248":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-109","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-polls","content":"understanding pain points"},"249":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-110","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-polls","content":"gauging interest in your offer"},"250":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-111","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-polls","content":"qualifying leads"},"251":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-112","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-polls","content":"gathering background"},"252":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-113","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-polls","content":"getting feedback on delivery"},"253":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-114","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-polls","content":"segmenting for follow-up"},"254":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-115","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-polls","content":"Click **Generate polls**. You get five polls, each with its question, its options, and a short note on why it's there and where it fits in the run of show. Click **Continue**."},"255":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-116","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-offers","content":"First choose how you want to position the offer:"},"256":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-117","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-offers","content":"| Positioning    | What it does                        |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Soft Pitch** | Education-focused, offer at the end |","table":"table-4"},"257":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-118","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-offers","content":"| Positioning           | What it does                                      |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Balanced Approach** | Value plus a clear offer throughout, strong close |","table":"table-4"},"258":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-119","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-offers","content":"| Positioning      | What it does                                 |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Direct Pitch** | Offer-focused, repeated CTAs, strong urgency |","table":"table-4"},"259":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-120","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-offers","content":"Then describe what you're selling and where the button should send people, and pick an offer category: online course, coaching programme, membership, digital product or service package. Click **Generate Offers**."},"260":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-121","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#generate-offers","content":"You get complete offers with a title, headline, sub-headline, button text and link. Select the ones you want and click **Save and continue**."},"261":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-122","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#finished-webinar","content":"*1 The webinar title, with its AI badge · 2 The nine tabs.*"},"262":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-123","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#finished-webinar","content":"The flow ends on the new webinar's **Overview**. From here it works exactly like a webinar built by hand."},"263":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-124","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#credits","content":"| Step   | Credits |\n| ------ | ------- |\n| Script | 10      |","table":"table-5"},"264":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-125","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#credits","content":"| Step          | Credits |\n| ------------- | ------- |\n| Landing pages | 10      |","table":"table-5"},"265":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-126","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#credits","content":"| Step   | Credits |\n| ------ | ------- |\n| Emails | 1       |","table":"table-5"},"266":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-127","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#credits","content":"| Step  | Credits |\n| ----- | ------- |\n| Polls | 1       |","table":"table-5"},"267":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-128","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#credits","content":"| Step   | Credits |\n| ------ | ------- |\n| Offers | 1       |","table":"table-5"},"268":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-129","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#credits","content":"| Step           | Credits |\n| -------------- | ------- |\n| **Full build** | **23**  |","table":"table-5"},"269":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-130","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#credits","content":"The script and pages are the expensive steps, which is another reason to get the prompt right before you generate. Each step shows your balance before you commit, and you can switch off any output chip to skip that part."},"270":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-131","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#after-generating","content":"Create with AI drafts the content. A few things are still yours to do:"},"271":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-132","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#after-generating","content":"**Set the schedule.** The build doesn't schedule sessions for you; set them on the Overview tab."},"272":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-133","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#after-generating","content":"**Choose a video** for simulive and evergreen webinars, which play a recording."},"273":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-134","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#after-generating","content":"**Read every page and email** before publishing, especially anything about price and what's included."},"274":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-135","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#after-generating","content":"**Publish the pages.** A registration link doesn't work until its page is published."},"275":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-136","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#after-generating","content":"**Tune the offers.** Add a countdown timer to an offer with a real deadline, or adjust the button URL."},"276":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-137","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#with-pages","content":"Generated pages open in the same drag-and-drop builder as any other, on the webinar's **Content** tab. Change templates, edit blocks, add **UTM Params** to the form, then publish. See Registration page builder."},"277":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-138","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#with-emails","content":"The generated sequence lives on the **Notifications** tab with every other email, where you can change subjects, content and timing. See Confirmation emails and Reminder emails."},"278":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-139","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#with-polls-and-offers","content":"Generated polls and offers appear on the **CTAs** tab, already written and editable like any other. See Polls and Offers."},"279":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-140","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#with-paid-webinars","content":"A webinar built with AI has the same pricing options as one built by hand. If you're charging for registration, read the generated pages and emails carefully so they describe the price and what's included correctly. See Paid webinars."},"280":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-141","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#other-ai-features","content":"Create with AI is one of several AI features in EasyWebinar. **Chat Simulation** can use AI to populate the chat on a recorded webinar; see Chat simulation. The **AI Moderator**, which answers attendee questions in the room, is available from Pro onward."},"281":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-142","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the feature fits different users."},"282":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-143","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#course-creators","content":"A creator describes a training webinar that teaches the core idea of a course, chooses the online course category and **Balanced Approach** for the offer, and edits the script before generating pages. See Course creators."},"283":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-144","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#coaches","content":"A coach launching a new programme generates the whole webinar in one sitting, downloads the script as a PDF to rehearse from, and picks **Soft Pitch** because the audience is new to them."},"284":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-145","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#small-business","content":"A solo operator without time to write six emails keeps the default chips (script, pages and emails), leaves **Polls** and **Offers** off, and builds a single offer by hand on the **CTAs** tab."},"285":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-146","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#product-teams","content":"A product team sets **Type** to **Evergreen** for an always-on product walkthrough, chooses poll goals for qualifying leads and segmenting for follow-up, then attaches their recorded demo as the video."},"286":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-147","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare","content":"EasyWebinar's Create with AI writes the presentation script, the registration pages, the email sequence, and the polls and offers from one description. You get a first draft of the whole funnel from one description, and you can edit all of it."},"287":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-148","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare","content":"AI webinar-building features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"288":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-149","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare","content":"| Platform        | AI writes the presentation script | AI writes the registration page | AI writes the email sequence | AI writes polls and offers |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                               | Yes                             | Yes                          | Yes                        |","table":"table-6"},"289":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-150","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare","content":"| Platform     | AI writes the presentation script | AI writes the registration page         | AI writes the email sequence | AI writes polls and offers      |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **eWebinar** | Not in docs                       | Partly (rewrites one section at a time) | Yes (a notification set)     | Yes (from the video transcript) |","table":"table-6"},"290":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-151","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare","content":"| Platform       | AI writes the presentation script | AI writes the registration page | AI writes the email sequence | AI writes polls and offers |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| **WebinarKit** | Yes (AI Creator Suite)            | Not in docs                     | Partly (marketing page only) | Not in docs                |","table":"table-6"},"291":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-152","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare","content":"| Platform                       | AI writes the presentation script | AI writes the registration page | AI writes the email sequence | AI writes polls and offers |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| **WebinarJam and EverWebinar** | Partly (AI Agenda Planner)        | Not in docs                     | Not in docs                  | Not in docs                |","table":"table-6"},"292":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-153","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare","content":"| Platform      | AI writes the presentation script | AI writes the registration page | AI writes the email sequence        | AI writes polls and offers |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Not in docs                       | Not in docs                     | Partly (post-event drafts, in beta) | Not in docs                |","table":"table-6"},"293":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-154","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"294":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-155","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare-stronger","content":"**A script, not just an outline.** EasyWebinar writes the script in named sections with timings and speaker notes. WebinarJam's AI Agenda Planner generates a webinar agenda. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar."},"295":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-156","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare-stronger","content":"**Whole pages written from the script.** EasyWebinar writes the registration, thank-you and waiting-area pages in one step. eWebinar's AI rewrites registration page sections one at a time. See EasyWebinar vs eWebinar."},"296":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-157","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare-stronger","content":"**Polls and offers in the same build.** EasyWebinar generates polls from the goals you pick, then offers in the pitch style you choose. WebinarKit's AI Creator Suite covers scripts, slide decks and avatar videos. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarKit."},"297":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-158","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare-stronger","content":"**Emails ready before the event.** EasyWebinar drafts the welcome email, three reminders and two follow-ups. Livestorm's AI drafts emails from an event recording, after the event. See EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"298":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-159","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"299":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-160","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#limits","content":"**Credits are spent per step.** About 23 for a full build; the script and pages are 10 each."},"300":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-161","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#limits","content":"**The prompt sets the quality.** Vague prompts produce generic webinars."},"301":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-162","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#limits","content":"**Scheduling isn't generated.** Set sessions yourself after the build."},"302":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-163","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#limits","content":"**Simulive and evergreen still need a video** after generation."},"303":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-164","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#limits","content":"**Five polls per poll step.** Each comes with its question, options and reasoning."},"304":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-165","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#limits","content":"**Everything is a draft.** Check pages and emails before you publish, particularly prices and inclusions."},"305":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-166","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#limits","content":"**The webinar type is fixed** once the webinar is created, so set **Type** before generating."},"306":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-167","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-how-long","content":"About 10 to 15 minutes end to end. The script is the slowest part, at roughly a minute and a half."},"307":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-168","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-credits","content":"Around 23 for all five parts: 10 for the script, 10 for the pages, and 1 each for emails, polls and offers."},"308":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-169","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-some-parts","content":"Yes. Turn off any of the five output chips before you click **Generate**."},"309":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-170","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-edit","content":"Yes, all of it. Pages open in the page builder, emails on the **Notifications** tab, and polls and offers on the **CTAs** tab."},"310":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-171","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-regenerate-script","content":"Yes. Use **Regenerate** on the script step. Change the number of slides or the duration first if you want a different result."},"311":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-172","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-types","content":"Yes. Set **Type** before generating, then choose a video once the webinar is built."},"312":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-173","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-present-script","content":"Yes. **Download PDF** on the script step saves it as a PDF."},"313":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-174","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-ai-badge","content":"They carry an **AI** badge on their card in **My Webinars**."},"314":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-175","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-good-prompt","content":"Be specific about the audience, what you'll cover, how long it runs, the tone, and what you're selling."},"315":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-176","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#faq-offer-positioning","content":"You choose: **Soft Pitch**, **Balanced Approach** or **Direct Pitch**."},"316":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-177","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#related","content":"Create and schedule a live webinar: the manual route, and where to set the schedule the AI build leaves to you."},"317":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-178","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#related","content":"Create a simulive webinar: choose the recording a simulive build still needs."},"318":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-179","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#related","content":"Create an evergreen webinar: build the always-on schedule for an evergreen build."},"319":{"id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai-180","page_id":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/ai/create-with-ai#related","content":"Limits and defaults: AI credits alongside every other allowance and default."},"320":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"page","content":"Webinar CRM Email Setup: Verify a Domain or Address and Choose a Sending Provider","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","EasyCRM"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup"},"321":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-0","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","content":"How to set up sending so CRM broadcasts and workflows go out from your own domain or address: pick an email service, verify a domain or business address, choose where replies go, and check sending before your first send."},"322":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-1","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"323":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-2","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup#what-it-is","content":"What webinar CRM email setup covers"},"324":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-3","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup#what-you-see","content":"What you see on the screen"},"325":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-4","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup#your-crm-or-ours","content":"Keep your CRM or use ours"},"326":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-5","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup#why-it-matters","content":"Why webinar CRM email sending matters"},"327":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-6","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup#what-its-for","content":"What it's for"},"328":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-7","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup#how-it-helps","content":"How it helps"},"329":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-8","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup#without-it","content":"What happens without it"},"330":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-9","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup#why-buyers-care","content":"Why buyers care"},"331":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-10","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup#approach","content":"The EasyWebinar approach to webinar CRM email sending"},"332":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-11","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup#how-authentication-works","content":"How email sender authentication works"},"333":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-12","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup#spf","content":"SPF: who may send for your domain"},"334":{"id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup-13","page_id":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/easycrm/sending-setup#dkim","content"