nt mappings / Custom fields** | The two halves of the integration |","table":"table-2"},"664":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-69","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-events-to-tags","content":"|     | Control           | What it does      |\n| --- | ----------------- | ----------------- |\n| 2   | **Add a mapping** | Builds a new rule |","table":"table-2"},"665":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-70","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-events-to-tags","content":"|     | Control              | What it does          |\n| --- | -------------------- | --------------------- |\n| 3   | **Current mappings** | Rules already running |","table":"table-2"},"666":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-71","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-events-to-tags","content":"A mapping is three choices: **When** (the event) → **Then** (the action) → **Value** (the tag). Pick each one and click **Add mapping**."},"667":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-72","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#events","content":"| Event          | Fires when someone |\n| -------------- | ------------------ |\n| **Registered** | Signs up           |","table":"table-3"},"668":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-73","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#events","content":"| Event        | Fires when someone |\n| ------------ | ------------------ |\n| **Attended** | Joins the session  |","table":"table-3"},"669":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-74","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#events","content":"| Event      | Fires when someone        |\n| ---------- | ------------------------- |\n| **Missed** | Registers and never shows |","table":"table-3"},"670":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-75","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#events","content":"| Event              | Fires when someone  |\n| ------------------ | ------------------- |\n| **Watched replay** | Views the recording |","table":"table-3"},"671":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-76","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#events","content":"| Event                   | Fires when someone |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------ |\n| **Didn't watch replay** | Never views it     |","table":"table-3"},"672":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-77","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#events","content":"| Event                    | Fires when someone                 |\n| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Joined webinar after** | Arrives later than a point you set |","table":"table-3"},"673":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-78","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#events","content":"| Event                   | Fires when someone            |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Left webinar before** | Leaves before a point you set |","table":"table-3"},"674":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-79","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#events","content":"| Event          | Fires when someone    |\n| -------------- | --------------------- |\n| **Left early** | Leaves before the end |","table":"table-3"},"675":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-80","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#events","content":"| Event                          | Fires when someone             |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------ |\n| **Stayed on webinar at least** | Stays a minimum length of time |","table":"table-3"},"676":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-81","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#events","content":"| Event            | Fires when someone      |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------- |\n| **Watched full** | Watches the whole thing |","table":"table-3"},"677":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-82","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#events","content":"| Event             | Fires when someone |\n| ----------------- | ------------------ |\n| **Clicked offer** | Clicks your offer  |","table":"table-3"},"678":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-83","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#starter-tags","content":"\"Registered\" is a weak signal; **Watched full** and **Clicked offer** are strong ones. Tag them separately so your sales team works the right people first:"},"679":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-84","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#starter-tags","content":"*Registered* → `webinar-registered`"},"680":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-85","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#starter-tags","content":"*Missed* → `webinar-no-show`, and trigger your replay sequence"},"681":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-86","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#starter-tags","content":"*Watched full* → `webinar-engaged`"},"682":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-87","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#starter-tags","content":"*Clicked offer* → `webinar-hot`, and notify sales"},"683":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-88","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-custom-fields","content":"The **Custom fields** tab sends webinar details into your CRM's own fields: \"Choose which of your CRM's custom fields should receive each piece of webinar data.\""},"684":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-89","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-custom-fields","content":"| Webinar data      | What it's for                        |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Webinar Title** | Which webinar this contact came from |","table":"table-4"},"685":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-90","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-custom-fields","content":"| Webinar data          | What it's for                     |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar Join Link** | The attendee's personal join link |","table":"table-4"},"686":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-91","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-custom-fields","content":"| Webinar data                | What it's for       |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Webinar Join Short Link** | A shortened version |","table":"table-4"},"687":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-92","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-custom-fields","content":"| Webinar data            | What it's for          |\n| ----------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| **Webinar Replay Link** | Their replay page link |","table":"table-4"},"688":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-93","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-custom-fields","content":"| Webinar data                  | What it's for       |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Webinar Replay Short Link** | A shortened version |","table":"table-4"},"689":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-94","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-custom-fields","content":"| Webinar data     | What it's for                                      |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Phone Number** | Their phone, if your registration form collects it |","table":"table-4"},"690":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-95","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-custom-fields","content":"Pick the matching CRM field beside each one. **Refresh** pulls in fields you have just created in the CRM."},"691":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-96","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#reminders-from-crm","content":"Mapping the **join link** lets you send reminders from your CRM instead of EasyWebinar's own reminder emails, because each contact gets their own working link."},"692":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-97","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#verify-the-result","content":"The integration shows under **Connected apps** as **Ready to use**."},"693":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-98","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#verify-the-result","content":"Your rules appear under **Current mappings**."},"694":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-99","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#verify-the-result","content":"Register a test contact and check the tag and fields arrive in your CRM."},"695":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-100","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#change-or-disconnect","content":"**Change integration** swaps the connected tool. **Disconnect** removes it from the webinar."},"696":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-101","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#what-it-is","content":"An integration links one webinar to a CRM or email tool you already use. It has two halves. **Event mappings** apply a tag when someone does something, such as attending or missing the session. **Custom fields** copy webinar details, such as the title and each person's join link, into fields on the contact."},"697":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-102","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#what-it-is","content":"Registrants and attendees are separate events, so the integration can tell someone who only signed up from someone who turned up. Everything is set on the webinar itself, not across your whole account."},"698":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-103","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#what-its-for","content":"CRM mapping brings your registrants and attendees into the system you already work in, without exporting anything. Each contact arrives with a tag that says what they did, so your next step can depend on it."},"699":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-104","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#how-it-helps","content":"**Follow-up matches behaviour.** A no-show can start a replay sequence, while an offer click goes to sales."},"700":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-105","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#how-it-helps","content":"**Strong signals stand out.** **Watched full** and **Clicked offer** sit apart from a plain registration."},"701":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-106","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#how-it-helps","content":"**Your CRM sends the reminders.** A mapped join link gives each contact their own working link."},"702":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-107","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#how-it-helps","content":"**Each webinar feeds its own list.** Integrations are set per webinar."},"703":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-108","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#without-it","content":"Everyone on the list gets the same follow-up, whether they watched to the end or never turned up. Interested people wait in a spreadsheet while the moment passes. Sales has no way to tell a casual sign-up from someone who clicked the offer."},"704":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-109","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#why-buyers-care","content":"It matters to teams whose pipeline already lives in a CRM. A webinar only counts there once its people show up in that CRM, tagged in a way that sales and marketing automation can act on. That is the point of tracking webinar leads in your CRM."},"705":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-110","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#approach","content":"Consider a typical case. A two-person revenue operations team at a payroll software company owns the HubSpot instance. Marketing runs a quarterly live briefing on payroll compliance for finance managers, and around 400 people register. The goal is to route engaged attendees to sales development reps within a day."},"706":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-111","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#approach","content":"A common workaround is to download the attendee list after each session, clean it up and import it into HubSpot. That tends to take a day or two, and the file usually holds only names and whether people attended. Reps then call everyone in the same order, and the warmest leads may cool while they wait."},"707":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-112","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#approach","content":"The briefing itself doesn't need to change. What changes is how much of each person's session reaches the CRM, and how fast. An attendee who stayed to the end is a different lead from one who left after ten minutes, and the CRM should know that."},"708":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-113","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#approach","content":"EasyWebinar connects HubSpot on the webinar's **Integrations** tab. The team maps **Watched full** to an engaged tag that alerts the reps, and **Missed** to a no-show tag for the replay sequence. On the **Custom fields** tab they map **Webinar Join Link**, so HubSpot can send its own reminders with each person's link."},"709":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-114","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#approach","content":"The events table under Map events to tags lists all eleven triggers, including **Left early** and **Stayed on webinar at least**. How other platforms tag behaviour and send webinar data to a CRM is covered in How CRM mapping compares, below."},"710":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-115","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-registration-fields","content":"The **Phone Number** field only has something to send if your registration form collected it. Select the form block in the page builder and add the **Phone** field; custom registration fields covers the other fields you can add."},"711":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-116","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-people-view","content":"People is every registrant and attendee across all your webinars in one table, and you can filter it by behaviour and source and export the list. It is a quick way to check who should have received a tag, or to follow up with people outside your CRM rules."},"712":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-117","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-cloning","content":"When you clone a webinar, **Integration settings** is one of the groups you can copy. Tick it to bring this webinar's integration settings across to the copy."},"713":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-118","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-easycrm","content":"You don't need EasyCRM to run webinars. It's for managing the people your webinars produce. Registrants reach it by connecting EasyCRM as an integration on a webinar, as on this page, or with **Import from EasyWebinar** on its Leads screen."},"714":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-119","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-easycast","content":"The **Social media** category on the Integrations tab is separate from CRMs. To broadcast a webinar to YouTube or LinkedIn while it runs, use EasyCast, under **Integrations** in the sidebar."},"715":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-120","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, showing how different teams set their mappings up."},"716":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-121","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#revops","content":"A RevOps team maps **Clicked offer** and **Watched full** to separate tags, so lead routing in the CRM can treat them as different signals. The **Webinar Title** field records which webinar each contact came from."},"717":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-122","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#marketing-teams","content":"A marketing team maps **Missed** and **Didn't watch replay** to tags that start a replay sequence. People who still haven't watched get a second nudge from the email tool the team already uses."},"718":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-123","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#course-creators","content":"A creator selling a course through webinars tags **Clicked offer** and keeps those contacts out of the general nurture sequence. That stops buyers who are close to purchase from getting beginner emails."},"719":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-124","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#several-webinars","content":"A team running one webinar per product line connects each webinar to its own list. When they launch a new live session from an existing one, cloning with **Integration settings** ticked keeps the mappings."},"720":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-125","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"EasyWebinar tags contacts by what they did in the session, sends each person's join link into a CRM field, and offers its own CRM, EasyCRM, that connects the same way. And it's your CRM or ours: keep the CRM you have, or use EasyCRM natively."},"721":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-126","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"CRM features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"722":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-127","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"| Platform        | Tags by what attendees did | Join link sent to a CRM field | Own CRM in the same product |\n| --------------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                        | Yes                           | Yes                         |","table":"table-5"},"723":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-128","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"| Platform  | Tags by what attendees did | Join link sent to a CRM field | Own CRM in the same product |\n| --------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Yes (segment by behaviour) | Yes (Unique Join Link)        | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-5"},"724":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-129","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"| Platform      | Tags by what attendees did            | Join link sent to a CRM field | Own CRM in the same product |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Partly (registrant and attendee data) | Yes (connection link)         | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-5"},"725":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-130","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"| Platform                       | Tags by what attendees did         | Join link sent to a CRM field | Own CRM in the same product |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **WebinarJam and EverWebinar** | Yes (attended, missed, left early) | Yes (live room link)          | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-5"},"726":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-131","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"| Platform     | Tags by what attendees did | Join link sent to a CRM field | Own CRM in the same product |\n| ------------ | -------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **eWebinar** | Yes (trigger-based tags)   | Yes (join links)              | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-5"},"727":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-132","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"728":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-133","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare-stronger","content":"**A CRM in the same product.** EasyCRM is EasyWebinar's own CRM and connects to a webinar like any other integration. Demio's integration guide has you connect an outside account in your User settings, and no Demio CRM is documented. See EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"729":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-134","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare-stronger","content":"**Tags for how long people stayed.** EasyWebinar's **Stayed on webinar at least** and **Watched full** each apply their own tag. Livestorm's HubSpot article describes sending registrant and attendee data to HubSpot. See EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"730":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-135","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare-stronger","content":"**Tags without a separate tool.** EasyWebinar's **When**, **Then** and **Value** choices tag contacts directly from the webinar. eWebinar's CRM guide also covers connecting products it doesn't integrate with directly through Zapier. See EasyWebinar vs eWebinar."},"731":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-136","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare-stronger","content":"**Points in the session you choose.** EasyWebinar's **Joined webinar after** and **Left webinar before** let you set the point in the session. WebinarJam's trigger examples include leaving early, evaluated after the session concludes. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar."},"732":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-137","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"733":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-138","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#limits","content":"**Integrations are per webinar.** Connecting one doesn't connect the rest, and different webinars can feed different lists."},"734":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-139","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#limits","content":"**Connecting needs an account with that service**, and you sign in to it during setup."},"735":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-140","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#limits","content":"**Tags and custom fields must exist in your CRM first.** Use **Refresh** after adding a field."},"736":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-141","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#limits","content":"**There are 15 integrations**, including EasyWebinar's own EasyCRM."},"737":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-142","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#limits","content":"**EasyCRM starts at Growth**, and native HubSpot and Salesforce Pardot sync starts at Pro."},"738":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-143","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-no-shows","content":"Yes, with the **Missed** event."},"739":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-144","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-how-many-events","content":"Eleven, from **Registered** to **Clicked offer**. Each mapping applies the tag you choose when its event fires."},"740":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-145","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-missing-field","content":"Create it in your CRM, then click **Refresh**."},"741":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-146","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-other-tools","content":"Check whether it accepts data from one of the listed platforms, or use EasyCRM."},"742":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-147","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-every-webinar","content":"Yes, integrations are set per webinar. Cloning a webinar with **Integration settings** ticked brings those settings across to the copy."},"743":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-148","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-different-lists","content":"Yes. Because each webinar has its own integration settings, each one can send people to a different list."},"744":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-149","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-registrants","content":"Yes. Registrants and attendees sync as separate events, so you can treat no-shows differently."},"745":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-150","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-join-link","content":"Yes. Map **Webinar Join Link** to one of your custom fields on the Custom fields tab."},"746":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-151","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-need-easycrm","content":"No. EasyCRM is for managing the people your webinars produce. Connect the CRM you already use instead if you prefer."},"747":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-152","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-streaming","content":"Not from this tab. Use **EasyCast**, a separate item under **Integrations** in the sidebar."},"748":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-153","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#related","content":"Offers and the countdown timer: the offers behind the **Clicked offer** event."},"749":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-154","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#related","content":"Limits and defaults: the per-webinar integration rule alongside other account limits."},"750":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-155","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#related","content":"Webinar analytics: compare attendance and offer clicks with what reached your CRM."},"751":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-156","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#related","content":"Team members and roles: give the colleagues who manage your integrations their own login."},"752":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-157","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#related","content":"Automate follow-ups with CRM tools: ideas for the sequences your tags can trigger."},"753":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"page","content":"Limits and defaults","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Reference"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults"},"754":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-0","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","content":"Every limit, allowance and default setting in EasyWebinar in one place, with its unit and where it applies."},"755":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-1","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#attendee-capacity","content":"Attendee capacity by plan"},"756":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-2","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#webinars-and-scheduling","content":"Webinars and scheduling"},"757":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-3","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#registration-and-selling","content":"Registration and selling"},"758":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-4","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/referenc