ance","content":"Everything EasyCRM sends draws on this monthly allowance, and its **Wallet** screen shows what's left. The allowance resets on your **signup date**, not the first of the month. Broadcasts and workflows draw on the same allowance, and each channel is counted separately."},"808":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-54","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#team-and-account","content":"| Item  | Value              | Notes                 |\n| ----- | ------------------ | --------------------- |\n| Roles | Owner, Admin, User | One Owner per account |","table":"table-6"},"809":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-55","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#team-and-account","content":"| Item       | Value               | Notes                              |\n| ---------- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| Team seats | Depend on your plan | Settings overview shows seats used |","table":"table-6"},"810":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-56","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#team-and-account","content":"| Item              | Value                | Notes                                                                       |\n| ----------------- | -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Client workspaces | Each on its own plan | Workspaces don't use team seats; built for agencies running client webinars |","table":"table-6"},"811":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-57","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#team-and-account","content":"| Item         | Value           | Notes                                             |\n| ------------ | --------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| Integrations | Set per webinar | Connecting one webinar doesn't connect the others |","table":"table-6"},"812":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-58","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#add-ons","content":"Every plan includes live webinars with browser join. Automation, EasyCRM, checkout and EasyCast start at Growth. AI Moderator answers attendee questions from Pro onward."},"813":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-59","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#add-ons","content":"Add-ons extend your plan without changing it. Switch one on with **Add to plan** on the **Add-ons** tab under **Settings → Manage Plan**."},"814":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-60","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#add-ons","content":"| Add-on          | What it unlocks              |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **White Label** | Removes EasyWebinar branding |","table":"table-7"},"815":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-61","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#add-ons","content":"| Add-on     | What it unlocks                   |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **C-Name** | A custom domain for webinar pages |","table":"table-7"},"816":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-62","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#add-ons","content":"