page visits to attendance | Each offer's views, clicks and purchases | Revenue split into registrations and offer sales | Live, replay and both, each person counted once |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Yes (detail)                          | Partly (clicks, no views or purchases)   | Not in docs                                      | Partly (separate replay summary)                |","table":"table-6"},"1565":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#compare","content":"| Platform      | Funnel from page visits to attendance | Each offer's views, clicks and purchases | Revenue split into registrations and offer sales | Live, replay and both, each person counted once |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Yes                                   | Not in docs                              | Not in docs                                      | Partly (replay viewers counted separately)      |","table":"table-6"},"1566":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#compare","content":"| Platform | Funnel from page visits to attendance | Each offer's views, clicks and purchases | Revenue split into registrations and offer sales | Live, replay and both, each person counted once |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Zoom** | Partly (visits via tracking links)    | Partly (link clicks on Webinars Plus)    | Not in docs                                      | Partly (recording views on Webinars Plus)       |","table":"table-6"},"1567":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#compare","content":"| Platform | Funnel from page visits to attendance | Each offer's views, clicks and purchases | Revenue split into registrations and offer sales | Live, replay and both, each person counted once |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **ON24** | Yes (detail)                          | Partly (clicks, no purchases)            | Not in docs                                      | Yes (detail)                                    |","table":"table-6"},"1568":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#compare","content":"| Platform     | Funnel from page visits to attendance | Each offer's views, clicks and purchases | Revenue split into registrations and offer sales | Live, replay and both, each person counted once |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **eWebinar** | Yes (detail)                          | Partly (purchases via a pixel)           | Partly (single total via pixel)                  | Partly (replay as a session type)               |","table":"table-6"},"1569":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"1570":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#compare-stronger","content":"**Offer results.** EasyWebinar's **Offers Performance** shows views, clicks and purchases for each offer. Demio's Featured Action shows clicks and the share of attendees who clicked, and its docs describe no purchase tracking. See EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"1571":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#compare-stronger","content":"**Revenue next to attendance.** EasyWebinar's **Revenue** view splits paid sign-ups from offers sold in the room. ON24's report docs show no revenue figure, and Livestorm's analytics docs show none either. See EasyWebinar vs ON24 and EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"1572":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#compare-stronger","content":"**Live and replay in one count.** EasyWebinar's **Total Attended** shows unique people, split into **Live only**, **Replay only** and **Both**. WebinarJam shows live and replay data separately, and Zoom reports recording views on Webinars Plus. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar and EasyWebinar vs Zoom."},"1573":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#compare-stronger","content":"**One date range for the whole tab.** Set a date range, click **Apply**, and every number on EasyWebinar's tab follows it. WebinarJam filters by webinar, session and event, with no custom date range described."},"1574":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 20 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"1575":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#limits","content":"**Analytics is per webinar.** The **People** page in the sidebar is the one that spans every webinar."},"1576":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#limits","content":"**The date range covers the whole page.** Widen it if numbers look low."},"1577":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#limits","content":"**A brand-new webinar shows zeros** until registrations start."},"1578":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#limits","content":"**Visitors are unique IPs** on your landing page."},"1579":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#limits","content":"**Replay views are counted separately** from live attendance; someone who did both appears under **Both**."},"1580":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#limits","content":"**Registration and offer revenue are reported separately**, under **Paid Webinar** and **Paid Offer**."},"1581":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#limits","content":"**An abandoned checkout isn't a registration.**"},"1582":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#faq-live-vs-total","content":"**Live Attended** is the live broadcast only. **Total Attended** counts unique people who watched live or on replay."},"1583":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#faq-no-shows","content":"Use **Missed**: people who registered and never attended."},"1584":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#faq-zeros","content":"Either the webinar hasn't run yet, or your date range doesn't cover the period when it did."},"1585":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#faq-offer-worked","content":"Check **Offers Performance** for views, clicks and purchases, and **Revenue by Offer** for what it earned."},"1586":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#faq-who-registered","content":"In the **People** view on the Analytics tab, or in People in the sidebar for every webinar at once."},"1587":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#faq-location","content":"Yes. **Registrations by country** is at the bottom of the Overview."},"1588":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#faq-unanswered","content":"**Questions & Answers** shows how many were asked and answered, and the **Not Answered Rate** shows how many you left behind."},"1589":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#faq-revenue-split","content":"No. **Revenue by Source** splits them, and the section below switches between **Paid Webinar** and **Paid Offer**."},"1590":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/webinar-analytics#faq-checkout-abandoned","