ebinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare","content":"| Platform  | Just-in-time sessions | Just-in-time, instant viewing and set times together | Hours kept free of just-in-time sessions | Live webinars in the same product |\n| --------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Not in docs           | Not in docs                                          | Not in docs                              | Yes (detail)                      |","table":"table-4"},"1721":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare","content":"| Platform      | Just-in-time sessions | Just-in-time, instant viewing and set times together | Hours kept free of just-in-time sessions | Live webinars in the same product |\n| ------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Not in docs           | Not in docs                                          | Not in docs                              | Yes (detail)                      |","table":"table-4"},"1722":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"1723":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare-stronger","content":"**A session minutes away.** EasyWebinar's **Just-in-time Registration** offers a session starting shortly after someone registers. Demio's help centre and product pages don't document a just-in-time option. Compare EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"1724":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare-stronger","content":"**Watch now, soon or at a set time.** EasyWebinar's **On Demand** starts the recording straight away, beside just-in-time and set times. StealthSeminar's instant choice, Watch Yesterday's Replay, plays the previous session. Compare EasyWebinar vs StealthSeminar."},"1725":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare-stronger","content":"**Quiet hours you choose.** **Exclude specific time** keeps chosen hours free of just-in-time sessions. WebinarKit's help centre covers just-in-time labels and spacing, with no hour exclusion documented. Compare EasyWebinar vs WebinarKit."},"1726":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare-stronger","content":"**Evergreen sessions that start soon.** EasyWebinar adds just-in-time to the evergreen schedule step. Livestorm's on-demand and automation pages don't document just-in-time sessions. Compare EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"1727":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"1728":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**Evergreen only.** Just-in-time is part of the evergreen schedule step. Live and simulive webinars use dated sessions in the webinar's timezone."},"1729":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**Fixed interval choices.** 2, 15, 30, 45 or 60 minutes."},"1730":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**Local time applies to just-in-time sessions only.** Other sessions on the same webinar use the webinar's timezone."},"1731":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**The schedule step's timezone message is broader than the behaviour.** Rely on the table above, not the in-app message."},"1732":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**The type is fixed.** To use just-in-time with a webinar that is currently live or simulive, clone it as Evergreen."},"1733":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-what-is-jit","content":"A session that starts a few minutes after someone registers, instead of at a fixed future time. In EasyWebinar it's an option on evergreen webinars."},"1734":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-how-often","content":"As often as you set with **Interval**: every 2, 15, 30, 45 or 60 minutes."},"1735":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-shortest","content":"Two minutes."},"1736":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-local-time","content":"Yes. Just-in-time sessions start shortly after each person registers, in their own local time."},"1737":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-recurring-timezone","content":"No. Recurring sessions run at the times you set, in the webinar's timezone."},"1738":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-exclude","content":"Yes. Use **Exclude specific time** to keep those hours clear."},"1739":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-with-on-demand","content":"Yes. Turn on **On Demand** as well; **Schedule Preferences** then reads **Display Just-in-time & Instant-replay**."},"1740":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-other-types","content":"No. It's an evergreen option. Clone the webinar as **Evergreen** to use it."},"1741":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-test","content":"Set the interval to 2 minutes, register on your own page, and watch for the session on the **Live** tab of the Sessions panel."},"1742":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-jit-name","content":"Yes. JIT is the common short name for **Just-in-time Registration**."},"1743":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"Create an evergreen webinar: the full setup that just-in-time is one step of."},"1744":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"On Demand: the option for registrants who want to watch now rather than in a few minutes."},"1745":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-148","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"Chat simulation: a chat for attendees who each arrive at a different moment."},"1746":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-149","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#