page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"2422":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-29","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-chat-vs-qa","content":"How is Q&A different from chat?"},"2423":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-30","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-public-or-private","content":"Should questions be public or private?"},"2424":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-31","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-private-who","content":"Who can see questions with Private Q&A?"},"2425":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-32","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-disable","content":"Can I turn Q&A off?"},"2426":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-33","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-where-in-room","content":"Where do I see questions during the webinar?"},"2427":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-34","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-moderator","content":"Can someone else answer questions while I present?"},"2428":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-35","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-change-live","content":"Can I change the Q&A setting once the webinar has started?"},"2429":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-36","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-not-answered","content":"How do I know how many questions I missed?"},"2430":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-37","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-simulive","content":"Does Q&A work on simulive webinars?"},"2431":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-38","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-ai-moderator","content":"Can the AI Moderator answer questions for me?"},"2432":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#related","content":"Related"},"2433":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","content":"Q&A in EasyWebinar is a question queue that runs separately from chat. Attendees submit questions, and you and your moderators work through them in the room's **Question** panel, which splits them into **Active** and **Answered**. You decide on the webinar's **Engagement** tab whether questions are visible to everyone, visible only to hosts and moderators, or switched off. After the session, Analytics shows how many questions were asked and how many you answered."},"2434":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                                                   |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it is** | A queue of attendee questions, separate from chat |","table":"table-0"},"2435":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                    |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Where you set it** | Webinar → **Engagement** → **Q&A** |","table":"table-0"},"2436":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#at-a-glance","content":"|             |                                                |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| **Options** | **Public Q&A**, **Private Q&A** or **Disable** |","table":"table-0"},"2437":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                          |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **When to set it** | Before the webinar, as part of its setup |","table":"table-0"},"2438":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                                                                                 |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **In the room** | The **Question** panel on the side rail, split into **Active** and **Answered** |","table":"table-0"},"2439":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                                                                                      |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Who answers** | Hosts and moderators; moderators join with the **Moderator Join Link for Live room** |","table":"table-0"},"2440":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                                                                 |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **After the session** | **Analytics → Questions & Answers**: questions asked and answered, with a **Not Answered Rate** |","table":"table-0"},"2441":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                           |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar types** | Live, simulive and evergreen, set up the same way on each |","table":"table-0"},"2442":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#what-it-is","content":"Chat is conversation: greetings, reactions, side remarks, attendees talking to each other. Q&A is a list. Each entry is a question, and your job is to work through the list during or at the end of the session."},"2443":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#what-it-is","content":"Keeping the two apart matters on any webinar with more than a handful of people. In a busy chat, a real question scrolls away under a stream of \"hello from Leeds\". In the Q&A queue, it waits until someone answers it."},"2444":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#what-it-is","content":"You also choose who can see the queue:"},"2445":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#what-it-is","content":"**Public**, so attendees can see what has already been asked."},"2446":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#what-it-is","content":"**Private**, so only hosts and moderators see the questions."},"2447":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#what-it-is","content":"**Off**, when the webinar shouldn't take questions at all."},"2448":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#what-its-for","content":"Q&A gives attendees a dependable way to ask something and a reasonable expectation that the question will be seen. For the presenter, it turns scattered questions into a list that can be answered in order."},"2449":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#how-it-helps","content":"**Questions don't get lost in chat.** They sit in their own queue until they are answered."},"2450":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#how-it-helps","content":"**Public Q&A cuts repeats.** When people can see a question has already been asked, you don't answer the same thing five times."},"2451":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#how-it-helps","content":"**Private Q&A keeps the room on track.** One attendee's question doesn't set the agenda for everyone else, and you choose what to address on air."},"2452":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#how-it-helps","content":"**You can see what's left.** The **Active** and **Answered** split in the room, and the **Not Answered Rate** afterwards, show what you didn't get to."},"2453":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#without-it","content":"Without Q&A, attendees have no dedicated place to ask, so many keep their questions to themselves. Those who do ask get no sign that anyone saw the question. You close the session without knowing what the room still wanted to know, and on a selling webinar an unanswered objection often decides the sale."},"2454":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#why-buyers-care","content":"Q&A matters most to teams that run demos, trainings and sales webinars. They want to answer questions without losing control of the room. A sociable chat with a private question queue, plus a count of what went unanswered afterwards, gives them that control."},"2455":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#approach","content":"Take a typical case. A customer success team at a software company runs a live release briefing for its customers every quarter. Around 300 account admins attend, and many arrive with questions about their own setup. One product manager presents, while two success managers support the session."},"2456":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#approach","content":"A common approach is to take questions in the main chat and read a few out at the end. In a busy room, those questions sit between greetings and reactions, so the presenter scrolls back and still misses some. Questions about one customer's account are also on show to every other customer. Admins whose questions were missed often raise a support ticket the next day."},"2457":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#approach","content":"Questions and conversation do different jobs, so they don't need to share one stream. A greeting needs no reply, while a question needs an owner and a record of whether it was answered. Once questions have their own list, a second person can work through it while the presenter keeps going."},"2458":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#approach","content":"EasyWebinar gives questions their own queue, set on the webinar's **Engagement** tab. The team keeps chat on **Everyone**, so the room stays sociable, and sets Q&A to **Private Q&A**, so account questions reach only hosts and moderators. The two success managers join with the **Moderator Join Link for Live room** and answer from the **Question** panel while the product manager presents."},"2459":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#approach","content":"The Q&A screenshot under Set up Q&A shows the three options side by side: **Public Q&A**, **Private Q&A** and **Disable**. After the briefing, the **Questions & Answers** panel in **Analytics** shows how many questions were asked and how many were answered. How other platforms handle attendee questions is covered in How Q&A compares, below."},"2460":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#set-up-qa","content":"Open your webinar and click the **Engagement** tab."},"2461":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#set-up-qa","content":"Click **Q&A**."},"2462":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#set-up-qa","content":"Choose one of the three options."},"2463":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#set-up-qa","content":"Save your changes."},"2464":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#set-up-qa","content":"| Option         | What happens                      |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Public Q&A** | Questions are visible to everyone |","table":"table-1"},"2465":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#set-up-qa","content":"| Option          | What happens                                       |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Private Q&A** | Questions are visible only to hosts and moderators |","table":"table-1"},"2466":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#set-up-qa","content":"| Option      | What happens                           |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Disable** | Q&A isn't available during the webinar |","table":"table-1"},"2467":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#public-or-private","content":"| Choose         | When                                                                                                                    |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Public Q&A** | You want attendees to see what's already been asked, and you're happy for questions to be part of the shared experience |","table":"table-2"},"2468":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#public-or-private","content":"| Choose          | When                                                                                            |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Private Q&A** | You want control over what the room sees, or questions may be personal, commercial or off-topic |","table":"table-2"},"2469":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#public-or-private","content":"| Choose      | When                                                                     |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Disable** | The session is a tightly controlled presentation with no questions taken |","table":"table-2"},"2470":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#pair-with-chat","content":"Q&A and chat are set side by side on the Engagement tab, and they work best chosen together."},"2471":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#pair-with-chat","content":"| You want                | Chat     | Q&A            |\n| ----------------------- | -------- | -------------- |\n| A lively public webinar | Everyone | **Public Q&A** |","table":"table-3"},"2472":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#pair-with-chat","content":"| You want                                   | Chat       | Q&A             |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ---------- | --------------- |\n| A sales session with private conversations | Hosts only | **Private Q&A** |","table":"table-3"},"2473":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#pair-with-chat","content":"| You want                          | Chat       | Q&A         |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------- | ----------- |\n| A tightly controlled presentation | Hosts only | **Disable** |","table":"table-3"},"2474":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#pair-with-chat","content":"| You want                                          | Chat                     | Q&A             |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | --------------- |\n| A large public webinar you can't moderate by hand | Everyone + AI Moderation | **Private Q&A** |","table":"table-3"},"2475":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#pair-with-chat","content":"| You want                                 | Chat                       | Q&A             |\n| ---------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | --------------- |\n| An automated webinar with simulated chat | Everyone + Chat Simulation | **Private Q&A** |","table":"table-3"},"2476":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#pair-with-chat","content":"**Everyone** for chat plus **Private Q&A** is a common setup: the room stays sociable, and questions reach you in an orderly queue."},"2477":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#answer-in-the-room","content":"When you enter the room, the side rail holds a **Question** panel. It is the Q&A queue, split into two lists:"},"2478":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#answer-in-the-room","content":"| List       | What it holds                         |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Active** | Questions still waiting for an answer |","table":"table-4"},"2479":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#answer-in-the-room","content":"| List         | What it holds               |\n| ------------ | --------------------------- |\n| **Answered** | Questions you've dealt with |","table":"table-4"},"2480":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#answer-in-the-room","content":"Q&A moderation preferences sit in the room's **Settings**, under **Preferences**, alongside chat moderation and appearance."},"2481":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#answer-in-the-room","content":"A few habits that keep the queue under control:"},"2482":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#answer-in-the-room","content":"**Keep an eye on Active during the session**, not only at the end, so a quick answer doesn't wait half an hour."},"2483":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#answer-in-the-room","content":"**Group similar questions** and answer them together on air."},"2484":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#answer-in-the-room","content":"**Leave time at the end** to clear what's left in Active before you close."},"2485":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#answer-in-the-room","content":"Ending the session disconnects everyone and nobody can rejoin, so finish the questions you want to answer before you click **End Session**."},"2486":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#moderators","content":"On a large webinar, a moderator can work the queue while the presenter keeps presenting. Send them the **Moderator Join Link for Live room** from the webinar's **Share** dialog; it is the link for someone handling chat and questions. Keep it private, because anyone holding it can join in that role."},"2487":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#recorded-webinars","content":"On a **simulive** webinar, chat and Q&A work normally. Everyone in a session sees the same moment of the video, and you and your moderators answer in real time while the recording plays."},"2488":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#recorded-webinars","content":"On an **evergreen** webinar, Q&A is set up the same way on the Engagement tab. There is also a separate built-in contact form, the **EW Contact Box**, which sends submitted questions to an email address you choose. On a recorded webinar, attendees find it under **Contact** in the room, on its **Question** tab. It is a different thing from the Q&A queue: questions arrive by email rather than in the room's **Question** panel."},"2489":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#recorded-webinars","content":"|                        | Q&A queue                     | Contact box                            |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Where questions go** | The room's **Question** panel | **Email address to receive questions** |","table":"table-5"},"2490":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#recorded-webinars","content":"|                   | Q&A queue                                                   | Contact box              |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **Who sees them** | Everyone or hosts and moderators, depending on your setting | Whoever reads that inbox |","table":"table-5"},"2491":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#recorded-webinars","content":"|                         | Q&A queue                | Contact box                |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| **Works with chat off** | Set separately from chat | Yes, even with **No Chat** |","table":"table-5"},"2492":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#with-chat","content":"Chat and Q&A are separate controls on the same tab. Chat's **Who can see messages** setting and the Q&A option are chosen separately, so you can run a public chat with private questions."},"2493":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#with-ai-moderation","content":"The AI Moderator, available from Pro onward, has a **Q&A Moderation** screen. With **Suggest Answer** it drafts an answer for you to approve before attendees see it; with **Answer directly** it answers without host approval. It doesn't replace a human moderator on a live webinar."},"2494":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#with-analytics","content":"The webinar's **Analytics** Overview includes a **Questions & Answers** panel showing how many questions were asked and how many you answered. The **Not Answered Rate** is a useful check after a busy session: it tells you how many questions you left behind."},"2495":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#with-follow-up","content":"Unanswered questions are a reason to follow up. **Webinar Follow-ups** on the **Notifications** tab can go to everyone who registered, only those who attended, or only no-shows."},"2496":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, to show how the setting changes with the kind of webinar."},"2497":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#product-teams","content":"A live product demo runs **Private Q&A**, so prospects can ask about pricing or their own setup without the room seeing. A solutions engineer joins as moderator and works the **Active** list while the presenter demos."},"2498":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#course-creators","content":"A creator teaching a free workshop uses **Public Q&A**. Attendees see that someone has already asked about prerequisites, and the creator answers the most common questions in a block before the enrolment offer."},"2499":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#customer-success","content":"A monthly onboarding webinar runs as a simulive session. Q&A stays private, and the team answers setup questions in real time while the recording plays, then checks the **Not Answered Rate** afterwards."},"2500":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#b2b-marketing","content":"A panel discussion is tightly scripted, so Q&A is set to **Disable** and chat to **Hosts only**. Questions still reach the team privately, without interrupting the panel."},"2501":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare","content":"EasyWebinar keeps questions in their own queue, lets you make that queue public or private, and reports how many questions went unanswered. The same Q&A setting runs on live, simulive and evergreen webinars. Real questions don't get lost in the chat, and you can see which ones you left behind."},"2502":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare","content":"Q&A features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"2503":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare","content":"| Platform        | Question queue separate from chat | Public or private questions | Answered and unanswered counts in analytics | Same Q&A setting on live, simulive and evergreen |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                               | Yes                         | Yes                                         | Yes                                              |","table":"table-6"},"2504":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare","content":"| Platform      | Question queue separate from chat | Public or private questions | Answered and unanswered counts in analytics | Same Q&A setting on live, simulive and evergreen |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Livestorm** | Yes (detail)                      | Yes (detail)                | Question count                              | Partly (advised off for on-demand)               |","table":"table-6"},"2505":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare","content":"| Platform  | Question queue separate from chat          | Public or private questions | Answered and unanswered counts in analytics | Same Q&A setting on live, simulive and evergreen |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------ | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Demio** | Partly (chat messages marked as questions) | Not in docs                 | Questions filter in chat analytics          | Via chat on automated events                     |","table":"table-6"},"2506":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare","content":"| Platform                       | Question queue separate from chat          | Public or private questions | Answered and unanswered counts in analytics | Same Q&A setting on live, simulive and evergreen |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **WebinarJam and EverWebinar** | Partly (chat messages marked as questions) | Not in docs                 | Questions in session logs                   | Partly (two separate products)                   |","table":"table-6"},"2507":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare","content":"| Platform     | Question queue separate from chat | Public or private questions | Answered and unanswered counts in analytics | Same Q&A setting on live, simulive and evergreen |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **eWebinar** | Questions go through chat         | Private chat only           | Chat message counts                         | Automated only                                   |","table":"table-6"},"2508":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare","content":"| Platform           | Question queue separate from chat | Public or private questions | Answered and unanswered counts in analytics | Same Q&A setting on live, simulive and evergreen |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **StealthSeminar** | Partly (questions sent by email)  | Not in docs                 | Replied filter on emailed questions         | Yes (by email)                                   |","table":"table-6"},"2509":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"2510":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare-stronger","content":"**Questions start in their own queue.** EasyWebinar collects them in the room's **Question** panel. In Demio and WebinarJam, a question is a chat message that the host or a moderator marks as one. See EasyWebinar vs Demio and EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar."},"2511":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare-stronger","content":"**A public chat with private questions.** EasyWebinar sets chat and Q&A separately, so **Everyone** chat can run beside **Private Q&A**. eWebinar's help centre describes its chat as private, with questions answered through that chat. See EasyWebinar vs eWebinar."},"2512":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare-stronger","content":"**A count of the questions you missed.** EasyWebinar's **Analytics** shows questions asked and answered, with a **Not Answered Rate**. Livestorm's analytics dashboard lists the number of questions. See EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"2513":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare-stronger","content":"**Questions stay in the webinar room.** EasyWebinar's Q&A queue lives in the room on live, simulive and evergreen webinars. StealthSeminar's Q&A is a message box that sends each question to you by email. See EasyWebinar vs StealthSeminar."},"2514":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 20 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"2515":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#limits","content":"**Set Q&A before the webinar.** It's part of the webinar's setup rather than the live room."},"2516":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#limits","content":"**Private means hosts and moderators.** Attendees don't see private questions."},"2517":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#limits","content":"**Disable removes Q&A for the whole session.**"},"2518":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#limits","content":"**The contact box is separate.** Contact box questions go to an email address, not to the **Question** panel."},"2519":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#limits","content":"**Ending the session is final.** **End Session** disconnects everyone and nobody can rejoin."},"2520":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#limits","content":"**The Not Answered Rate is after the fact.** Use **Active** in the room to see what's waiting while you're live."},"2521":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-chat-vs-qa","content":"Chat is a running conversation. Q&A collects questions in a list you work through, and with **Private Q&A** attendees don't see it."},"2522":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-public-or-private","content":"Public if you want people to see what's already been asked. Private if you want control over what the room sees."},"2523":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-private-who","content":"Only hosts and moderators."},"2524":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-disable","content":"Yes. Choose **Disable**, and Q&A isn't available during the webinar."},"2525":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-where-in-room","content":"In the **Question** panel on the room's side rail, split into **Active** and **Answered**."},"2526":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-moderator","content":"Yes. Send them the **Moderator Join Link for Live room** from the **Share** dialog."},"2527":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-change-live","content":"Choose it before the session. Q&A is set on the Engagement tab as part of the webinar's setup, not from the live room."},"2528":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-not-answered","content":"Check the **Questions & Answers** panel in **Analytics**. The **Not Answered Rate** shows how many questions were left behind."},"2529":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers#faq-simulive","content":"Yes. Chat and Q&A work normally, and you answer in real time while the recording plays."},"2530":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/questions-answers-137","page_id":"/product-doc