inars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                            |      |\n| -------------------------- | ---- |\n| **Effect on the original** | None |","table":"table-0"},"2783":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                               |                                                |\n| ----------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| **Removing an unwanted copy** | Archive it; webinars are archived, not deleted |","table":"table-0"},"2784":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Know which type you want the copy to be.** You choose it in the dialog, and it is fixed on the new webinar once created."},"2785":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Check you have a recording if the copy will be simulive or evergreen.** Those types play a video. A live webinar's recording is in the Library if **Auto Recording** was on when it ran."},"2786":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Decide what to leave behind.** Everything is ticked if you choose **Select everything**, but you can untick, for example, the emails if the copy needs new ones."},"2787":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/