,"tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                              |                                                                                              |\n| ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Changing the video later** | **Webinar Video** panel on the **Content** tab, without disturbing schedule or registrations |","table":"table-0"},"3306":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                   |\n| --------------- | ----------------- |\n| **Also called** | Automated webinar |","table":"table-0"},"3307":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Have the recording to hand.** Every session plays it. You can upload or import it during setup if it isn't in your library yet."},"3308":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Decide how people should be able to watch.** Soon after registering, straight away, at set times, or a mix. The schedule step is built around that choice."},"3309":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Know your audience's hours.** Recurring sessions run in the webinar's timezone, so pick times that work for the people you expect."},"3310":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Charging for access?** Paid registration needs a connected Stripe account. See Paid webinars."},"3311":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Confirm the type.** A webinar's type can't be changed after creation. If you have a live webinar you want to run this way, see Clone a webinar instead."},"3312":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#start-new-webinar","content":"Click **My Webinars** in the sidebar."},"3313":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#start-new-webinar","content":"Click **Create a Webinar**, then **Create Manually**."},"3314":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#start-new-webinar","content":"**Create with AI** also supports evergreen: set **Type** before generating, then choose the video afterwards. See Create with AI."},"3315":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#name-and-type","content":"Enter the **Webinar Name** your registrants will see."},"3316":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#name-and-type","content":"Choose the **Evergreen Webinar** card. It reads: pre-recorded content available 24/7, with viewers watching on their own schedule."},"3317":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#name-and-type","content":"Click **Continue to Schedule**."},"3318":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#build-schedule","content":"The schedule step is where an evergreen webinar differs from every other type. It offers three ways for people to watch, plus controls for when the schedule runs."},"3319":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#build-schedule","content":"*1 Just-in-time Registration · 2 On Demand · 3 Recurring Schedule · 4 Availability · 5 Schedule Preferences.*"},"3320":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#build-schedule","content":"|     | Option                        | What your registrant gets                 |\n| --- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Just-in-time Registration** | A session starting a few minutes from now |","table":"table-1"},"3321":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#build-schedule","content":"|     | Option        | What your registrant gets                           |\n| --- | ------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **On Demand** | Playback straight away, with no session to wait for |","table":"table-1"},"3322":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#build-schedule","content":"|     | Option                 | What your registrant gets            |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 3   | **Recurring Schedule** | Fixed session times, daily or weekly |","table":"table-1"},"3323":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#build-schedule","content":"|     | Option           | What your registrant gets                                                    |\n| --- | ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Availability** | Not a viewing option: the date the schedule starts, and an optional end date |","table":"table-1"},"3324":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#build-schedule","content":"|     | Option                   | What your registrant gets                                                    |\n| --- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 5   | **Schedule Preferences** | Not a viewing option: how many choices a registrant sees, and blackout dates |","table":"table-1"},"3325":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#build-schedule","content":"Switch on as many of the three viewing options as you like. Each one you enable shows on the registration page as a choice."},"3326":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#just-in-time","content":"Turn it on and the registration page offers a session that starts shortly. **Interval** controls how often these sessions come round, from every 2 minutes to every 60, and **Exclude specific time** keeps chosen hours clear. Just-in-time sessions run in each attendee's own local time. Settings, timezone behaviour and testing are covered in Just-in-time webinars."},"3327":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#on-demand","content":"Turn it on and registrants can start watching as soon as they register. **Instant replay text** sets the wording of the button they click, which reads *Watch instant replay* until you change it. On Demand is the same thing as instant replay, and it is not the replay page on the **Replay** tab. See On Demand."},"3328":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#recurring-schedule","content":"Set **Schedule Frequency** to **Daily** or **Weekly**."},"3329":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#recurring-schedule","content":"Set the time sessions should start."},"3330":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#recurring-schedule","content":"Click **Add Time** for another slot on the same day."},"3331":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#recurring-schedule","content":"Recurring sessions play at the times you enter, in the webinar's timezone. A session set for 2:00 AM starts at 2:00 AM in that timezone for everyone who picked it."},"3332":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#availability","content":"**Start Date** is the day the schedule begins. Leave **End Date** on **No end date** if the webinar should keep running indefinitely, or set a date for a campaign with a finish."},"3333":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#schedule-preferences","content":"**Schedule Preferences** decides how many session choices a registrant sees. With just-in-time and On Demand both enabled, it reads **Display Just-in-time & Instant-replay**. Turn on **Blackout Dates** and pick the days the webinar shouldn't run, such as holidays."},"3334":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#schedule-preferences","content":"When the schedule is set, click **Continue to Pricing**."},"3335":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#schedule-preferences","content":"The schedule step shows a message saying attendees will see times in their local time based on the selected timezone. On an evergreen webinar that applies to just-in-time sessions only. Daily and weekly sessions run at the times you set, in the webinar's timezone."},"3336":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#pricing","content":"Choose **Free** or **Paid**."},"3337":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#pricing","content":"Click **Continue to Video Selection**."},"3338":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#pricing","content":"If you choose **Paid**, you'll need a connected Stripe account. See Paid webinars."},"3339":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#choose-video","content":"The video you pick here is the recording every session plays, whichever way a registrant chooses to watch."},"3340":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#choose-video","content":"*1 All · Videos · Recordings · 2 Search and sort · 3 Add Video · 4 Drag and drop · 5 Your library.*"},"3341":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#choose-video","content":"|     | Control                       | What it does                                                                      |\n| --- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **All · Videos · Recordings** | Shows everything, only videos you have added, or only recordings of past webinars |","table":"table-2"},"3342":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#choose-video","content":"|     | Control             | What it does             |\n| --- | ------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| 2   | **Search and sort** | Looks a video up by name |","table":"table-2"},"3343":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#choose-video","content":"|     | Control       | What it does                       |\n| --- | ------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Add Video** | Adds a video from inside this step |","table":"table-2"},"3344":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#choose-video","content":"|     | Control           | What it does                       |\n| --- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Drag and drop** | Uploads a file dropped on the page |","table":"table-2"},"3345":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#choose-video","content":"|     | Control          | What it does                |\n| --- | ---------------- | --------------------------- |\n| 5   | **Your library** | Selects the video you click |","table":"table-2"},"3346":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#choose-video","content":"Select a video and click **Continue to Registration Template**."},"3347":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#choose-video","content":"If the video isn't in your library, **Add Video** gives you **Local import**, where EasyWebinar hosts the file, or **Import from URL** for YouTube, Vimeo, Wistia or a direct MP4 link. An imported video needs its length as well as its link. Uploads can be MP4, MOV or WebM, up to 4 GB. See Video hosting for both routes in detail."},"3348":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#choose-video","content":"A recording of a webinar you have already run sits under **Recordings**. Choosing it turns that session into the content of the evergreen webinar."},"3349":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#template","content":"Pick a registration template, or click **Skip & Create Webinar** and choose one later. Edit and publish the page in the builder before you send anyone to it. See Registration page builder."},"3350":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#verify","content":"Open the webinar's **Overview** tab."},"3351":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#verify","content":"*1 Scheduling Options · 2 Sessions.*"},"3352":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#verify","content":"|     | Panel                  | What to check                                                |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 1   | **Scheduling Options** | Frequency, start date, timezone and the preference you chose |","table":"table-3"},"3353":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#verify","content":"|     | Panel        | What to check                             |\n| --- | ------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Sessions** | The sessions generated from your schedule |","table":"table-3"},"3354":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#verify","content":"Three things confirm the setup worked:"},"3355":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#verify","content":"**The timezone reads Attendee's local timezone** when just-in-time is on, because those sessions start shortly after each person registers, in their own time."},"3356":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#verify","content":"**The Sessions list fills itself.** A daily schedule produces a long run of upcoming sessions with no manual entry."},"3357":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#verify","content":"**There is a Live tab** in the Sessions panel next to **Upcoming**, **Past** and **Cancelled**. Evergreen webinars have it; it shows sessions on air at that moment."},"3358":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#test-a-session","content":"To see your evergreen webinar the way attendees do, register on your own registration page. With just-in-time on and the interval at 2 minutes, the shortest option, a session starts within minutes. When a session is running, it appears on the **Live** tab of the Sessions panel marked *Live now*, with **Enter room**."},"3359":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#what-it-is","content":"An evergreen webinar is one of EasyWebinar's three types. Live webinars are presented in real time; simulive webinars broadcast a recording at times you set, with everyone watching together. Evergreen also plays a recording, but the schedule repeats and each registrant chooses their own time."},"3360":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#what-it-is","content":"| Question                      | Evergreen answer                                      |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| Who chooses the session time? | The registrant, from the options your schedule offers |","table":"table-4"},"3361":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#what-it-is","content":"| Question                     | Evergreen answer                                                 |\n| ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Do attendees watch together? | Not necessarily; each registrant watches the session they picked |","table":"table-4"},"3362":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#what-it-is","content":"| Question                  | Evergreen answer |\n| ------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| Does it need you present? | No               |","table":"table-4"},"3363":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#what-it-is","content":"| Question                                              | Evergreen answer              |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| Do pages, emails, polls, offers and analytics differ? | No; only the delivery differs |","table":"table-4"},"3364":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#what-it-is","content":"For the scheduled-broadcast version, see Create a simulive webinar."},"3365":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#what-its-for","content":"Evergreen suits a webinar that belongs to a funnel and should work whether or not you're free. Typical examples are a product demo, customer onboarding or a year-round offer. People reach it at all hours, so it has to be ready whenever they do."},"3366":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**Interest meets a session quickly.** With **Just-in-time Registration** or **On Demand**, a visitor doesn't have to come back another day to watch."},"3367":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**The schedule maintains itself.** A **Daily** or **Weekly** schedule keeps generating sessions from its **Start Date**, with no end unless you set one."},"3368":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**It runs without staff.** Nobody needs to present, and Chat Simulation exists for rooms that run unattended."},"3369":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**Days off stay off.** **Blackout Dates** stop sessions on holidays and any other days you pick."},"3370":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#without-it","content":"Without an evergreen schedule, a recording reaches people only on the dates it is shown. Anyone who finds the page between showings has to wait, and many lose interest before the next one comes round."},"3371":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#why-buyers-care","content":"It matters most to SaaS, customer success and course teams who run a webinar as a standing channel rather than a launch-day event. The moment that counts is the first visit, when someone is interested enough to register."},"3372":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#approach","content":"Consider a typical SaaS team that runs a product demo every Tuesday at 11:00. A sales engineer presents it, and prospects who click the demo link on the pricing page sign up for the next Tuesday. The demo barely changes from one week to the next."},"3373":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#approach","content":"A common approach is to keep presenting it live, or to upload the recording and create a new dated session each week. Presenting live costs an engineer's hour every Tuesday. The dated route relies on someone remembering the setup. Either way, a prospect who signs up on a Wednesday waits six days to see the product."},"3374":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#approach","content":"The demo is the same every week, so the presenter is not what makes each session work. Once it is recorded, sessions can repeat by themselves. The wait can then shrink to minutes for anyone who registers between Tuesdays."},"3375":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#approach","content":"EasyWebinar turns that recording into one evergreen webinar with a single schedule. The team keeps its Tuesday slot as a **Weekly** **Recurring Schedule** and switches on **Just-in-time Registration** beside it. The registration page offers both as choices, so the Wednesday prospect can take a session that begins minutes later instead of next week."},"3376":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#approach","content":"When the product changes, the team re-records the demo and swaps it in the **Webinar Video** panel on the **Content** tab. The swap leaves the schedule and existing registrations as they were, so nobody booked for Tuesday has to sign up again. The comparison with other evergreen tools is in How evergreen webinars compare, below."},"3377":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#with-jit-and-on-demand","content":"Just-in-time and On Demand are both switched on in Step 3 above. Both can run alongside a recurring schedule, and the registration page shows each one you enable as a choice."},"3378":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#with-chat-simulation","content":"On an automated webinar, people arrive at different times, so a shared live conversation isn't possible. Turn on **Chat Simulation** on the **Engagement** tab to fill the chat with an AI-generated or CSV-scripted conversation. See Chat simulation."},"3379":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#with-chat-options","content":"Evergreen webinars can use **Easywebinar Chat**, embed an external chat tool with **Third party**, or turn chat off with **No Chat** while keeping the **EW Contact Box** for questions sent by email."},"3380":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#with-ai-moderator","content":"The **AI Moderator** answers attendee questions from documents you upload and keeps the chat civil. It's available from Pro onward. It's aimed at large webinars and automated ones running without you."},"3381":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#with-notifications","content":"Reminder timing on the **Notifications** tab is relative to the webinar, so reminders follow evergreen schedules rather than one fixed date. See Reminder emails and Confirmation emails."},"3382":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#with-replay-page","content":"The replay page on the **Replay** tab is for people who missed a session that has already happened. It is separate from On Demand. See Replay pages."},"3383":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#with-analytics","content":"Chat, Q&A, polls, offers, emails and analytics behave as on any other webinar. In **People**, filtering by **Webinar → Evergreen** shows how the automated funnel performs against your live sessions. See Webinar analytics and People."},"3384":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#with-plan-usage","content":"People watching evergreen sessions count towards the **Automated attendees** meter on the **Plan** tab."},"3385":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the type is used."},"3386":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#course-creators","content":"A creator runs a teaching webinar that ends with an enrolment offer, on a daily schedule with just-in-time sessions. The webinar sells the course while the course itself stays on the creator's own platform. See Selling online courses with webinars."},"3387":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#saas-teams","content":"A product team puts a recorded demo behind its \"see it in action\" link. With just-in-time on, a visitor who registers can be watching within minutes, while the details are still fresh in their mind."},"3388":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#customer-success","content":"A customer success team turns its onboarding walkthrough into an evergreen webinar with On Demand switched on, so new customers can watch the moment they sign up instead of waiting for a scheduled session."},"3389":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#small-business","content":"A solo operator who can't present every day records a single webinar and runs it on a weekly schedule, with blackout dates over holidays and Chat Simulation keeping the room from looking empty."},"3390":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare","content":"In EasyWebinar, one evergreen webinar can offer just-in-time sessions, On Demand viewing and set times, all on one page. It can host the video itself, and live webinars run in the same product. So you can run it live, then let it run every day, with one login and one subscription."},"3391":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare","content":"Evergreen features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"3392":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-148","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform        | Just-in-time, on-demand and set times in one webinar | Hosts the video itself | Live webinars in the same product |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                                                  | Yes                    | Yes                               |","table":"table-5"},"3393":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-149","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform        | Just-in-time, on-demand and set times in one webinar | Hosts the video itself  | Live webinars in the same product |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **EverWebinar** | Yes (detail)                                         | External video required | Separate product (WebinarJam)     |","table":"table-5"},"3394":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-150","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform     | Just-in-time, on-demand and set times in one webinar | Hosts the video itself | Live webinars in the same product |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **eWebinar** | Yes (detail)                                         | Yes (detail)           | Not in docs                       |","table":"table-5"},"3395":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-151","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform           | Just-in-time, on-demand and set times in one webinar | Hosts the video itself | Live webinars in the same product |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **StealthSeminar** | Partly (on-demand as yesterday's replay)             | Yes (detail)           | Via YouTube Live or Twitch        |","table":"table-5"},"3396":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-152","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform  | Just-in-time, on-demand and set times in one webinar | Hosts the video itself | Live webinars in the same product |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Partly (just-in-time not in docs)                    | Yes (detail)           | Yes (detail)                      |","table":"table-5"},"3397":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-153","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform      | Just-in-time, on-demand and set times in one webinar | Hosts the video itself | Live webinars in the same product |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Partly (on-demand can't be recurring)                | Yes                    | Yes                               |","table":"table-5"},"3398":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-154","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"3399":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-155","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"**All three ways to watch in one webinar.** EasyWebinar offers just-in-time, On Demand and set times together on one page. Livestorm says recurring events can't be set up on-demand, and Demio's public docs show no just-in-time option. See EasyWebinar vs Livestorm and EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"3400":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-156","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"**Video hosting in the same flow.** With **Local import**, EasyWebinar hosts the video itself, so you don't need a YouTube or Vimeo account. EverWebinar's help centre says an external video source is required. See EasyWebinar vs EverWebinar."},"3401":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-157","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"**From live to automated in one switch.** EasyWebinar lists recordings of your past webinars under **Recordings** when you pick the video. EverWebinar can import a past WebinarJam session if the same account has an active WebinarJam subscription. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar."},"3402":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-158","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"**Live webinars built in.** EasyWebinar runs live, simulive and evergreen webinars from one account. eWebinar's public docs show no live video broadcast, and StealthSeminar streams live video in from YouTube Live or Twitch. See EasyWebinar vs eWebinar and EasyWebinar vs Stealth Seminar."},"3403":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-159","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 20 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"3404":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-160","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#limits","content":"**The type is fixed.** To change an evergreen webinar into another type, or a live one into evergreen, clone it."},"3405":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-161","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#limits","content":"**A recording is required.** Every session plays the video chosen at creation or later on the **Content** tab."},"3406":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-162","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#limits","content":"**Only just-in-time sessions use local time.** Recurring daily and weekly sessions run in the webinar's timezone, despite the message on the schedule step."},"3407":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-163","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#limits","content":"**The interval options are fixed:** 2, 15, 30, 45 or 60 minutes."},"3408":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-164","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#limits","content":"**Imported videos need an accurate duration.** It's how EasyWebinar knows how long each session runs."},"3409":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-165","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#limits","content":"**Chat Simulation runs one mode at a time:** AI or manual, not both."},"3410":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-166","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#limits","content":"**The AI Moderator is available from Pro onward.**"},"3411":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-167","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#faq-vs-simulive","content":"Both play a recording. Simulive broadcasts it at times you set, so everyone in a session watches together. Evergreen repeats on a schedule and each registrant picks the session that suits them."},"3412":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-168","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#faq-all-three","content":"Yes. Enable all three and the registration page presents each as a choice."},"3413":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-169","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#faq-jit","content":"It starts a few minutes after someone registers rather than at a fixed future time."},"3414":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-170","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#faq-on-demand-vs-replay","content":"No. On Demand lets a registrant watch straight away. The replay page shows the recording of a session that has already happened."},"3415":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-171","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#faq-timezone","content":"For just-in-time sessions, yes. Daily and weekly sessions run in the webinar's timezone."},"3416":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-172","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#faq-blackout","content":"Turn on **Blackout Dates** in **Schedule Preferences** and choose the dates."},"3417":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-173","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#faq-end-date","content":"Only if you set an **End Date**. Left on **No end date**, the schedule runs indefinitely."},"3418":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-174","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#faq-video-host","content":"No. Upload it with **Local import** and EasyWebinar hosts it. Importing a link is optional."},"3419":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-175","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#faq-replace-video","content":"Yes, from the **Webinar Video** panel on the **Content** tab. The schedule and registrations stay as they are."},"3420":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-176","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#faq-from-live","content":"No. Clone the live webinar, choose **Evergreen** for the copy, and select the live session's recording. See Clone a webinar."},"3421":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-177","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#related","content":"Just-in-time webinars: choosing an interval and testing a session that starts minutes after registering."},"3422":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-178","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#related","content":"On Demand: wording the instant replay button and how it differs from the replay page."},"3423":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-179","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#related","content":"Create a simulive webinar: the other recorded type, with everyone watching at set times."},"3424":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-180","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#related","content":"Chat simulation: keeping the chat active when registrants watch at different times."},"3425":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar-181","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-an-evergreen-webinar#related","content":"Video hosting: uploading or importing the recording every session plays."},"3426":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","type":"page","content":"Webinars overview","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars"},"3427":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars","content":"The three webinar types, what every webinar is made of, and how registration, the room, follow-up and analytics fit together."},"3428":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-1","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-types","content":"The three webinar types"},"3429":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-2","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars#live","content":"Live"},"3430":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-3","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars#simulive","content":"Simulive"},"3431":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-4","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars#evergreen","content":"Evergreen"},"3432":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-5","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars#which-to-choose","content":"Which to choose"},"3433":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-6","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-parts","content":"What every webinar is made of"},"3434":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-7","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars#objects","content":"The objects you work with"},"3435":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-8","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars#lifecycle","content":"From registration to follow-up"},"3436":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-9","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars#next-steps","content":"Next steps"},"3437":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-10","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-types","content":"You choose a type when you create a webinar. **The type can't be changed afterwards**, so it is worth deciding first."},"3438":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-11","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#live","content":"You present in real time at a specific date and time. Chat and Q&A happen as they happen. Choose Live when people come for the interaction: a launch, a workshop, a session where you answer real questions."},"3439":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-12","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#simulive","content":"A recording plays at times you set, like a scheduled broadcast. Everyone in a session sees the same moment, so the chat still works as a shared room, and you can answer questions live while the recording plays."},"3440":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-13","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#evergreen","content":"A recording runs on a repeating schedule, and each registrant picks a time that suits them. Use it when the webinar is part of a funnel that should work whether or not you are available."},"3441":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-14","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#evergreen","content":"An evergreen schedule can offer just-in-time sessions, On Demand viewing and a recurring daily or weekly schedule. All three can run at once, and the registrant picks."},"3442":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-15","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#which-to-choose","content":"| If you want                                               | Choose   |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | -------- |\n| To present in real time and answer questions as they come | **Live** |","table":"table-0"},"3443":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-16","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#which-to-choose","content":"| If you want                                                        | Choose       |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------ |\n| A polished recording, broadcast at set times, with you in the chat | **Simulive** |","table":"table-0"},"3444":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-17","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#which-to-choose","content":"| If you want                                                                 | Choose        |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- |\n| A session running continuously, with each registrant picking their own time | **Evergreen** |","table":"table-0"},"3445":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-18","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#which-to-choose","content":"| If you want                                                | Choose                        |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| To run the same session weekly without presenting it again | **Simulive** or **Evergreen** |","table":"table-0"},"3446":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-19","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#which-to-choose","content":"| If you want                                    | Choose        |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | ------------- |\n| To record once and let it sell while you sleep | **Evergreen** |","table":"table-0"},"3447":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-20","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#which-to-choose","content":"Live and Simulive need you to pick dates. Evergreen takes care of scheduling for you. Simulive and Evergreen play a recording; Live does not need one."},"3448":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-21","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#which-to-choose","content":"To turn a live webinar into an evergreen one, run it live first, then clone it and choose Evergreen on the copy. Cloning is the supported path because the type is fixed."},"3449":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-22","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-parts","content":"All three types use the same pages, emails, polls, offers and analytics. Only the delivery differs. Each webinar has these tabs:"},"3450":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-23","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-parts","content":"| Tab          | What you do there                                                       |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Overview** | See registrants and revenue, share links, add presenters and moderators |","table":"table-1"},"3451":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-24","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-parts","content":"| Tab         | What you do there                                                                      |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Content** | Edit the five webinar pages: registration, thank-you, waiting area, webinar and replay |","table":"table-1"},"3452":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-25","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-parts","content":"| Tab      | What you do there       |\n| -------- | ----------------------- |\n| **CTAs** | Create polls and offers |","table":"table-1"},"3453":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-26","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-parts","content":"| Tab            | What you do there               |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Engagement** | Set up chat, Q&A and moderation |","table":"table-1"},"3454":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-27","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-parts","content":"| Tab               | What you do there                                |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Notifications** | Emails, SMS and WhatsApp messages to registrants |","table":"table-1"},"3455":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-28","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-parts","content":"| Tab              | What you do there                            |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Integrations** | Connect a CRM or email tool for this webinar |","table":"table-1"},"3456":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-29","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-parts","content":"| Tab           | What you do there                             |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| **Analytics** | Registrations, attendance, offers and revenue |","table":"table-1"},"3457":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-30","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-parts","content":"| Tab        | What you do there                               |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Replay** | How and for how long the recording is available |","table":"table-1"},"3458":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-31","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-parts","content":"| Tab          | What you do there                                       |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Settings** | Webinar-level options such as showing the attendee list |","table":"table-1"},"3459":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-32","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#webinar-parts","content":"The webinar header also has **Registration Page**, **Share** and **Enter Room**."},"3460":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-33","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#objects","content":"| Object      | What it is                                      |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar** | Type, schedule, pricing, pages, emails and CTAs |","table":"table-2"},"3461":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-34","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#objects","content":"| Object      | What it is                                            |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Session** | One sitting of a webinar: upcoming, past or cancelled |","table":"table-2"},"3462":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-35","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#objects","content":"| Object         | What it is                        |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Registrant** | A person registered for a session |","table":"table-2"},"3463":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-36","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#objects","content":"| Object             | What it is              |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------- |\n| **Offer and poll** | A CTA shown in the room |","table":"table-2"},"3464":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-37","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#objects","content":"| Object          | What it is                                           |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Transaction** | A paid registration or offer purchase, with a status |","table":"table-2"},"3465":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-38","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#objects","content":"Webinars are archived, not deleted."},"3466":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#lifecycle","content":"Someone registers on your registration page, paying first if the webinar is paid."},"3467":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#lifecycle","content":"They get confirmation and reminder emails from the Notifications tab."},"3468":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#lifecycle","content":"They join live, or watch the recording at their session time."},"3469":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#lifecycle","content":"You show polls and offers in the room."},"3470":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#lifecycle","content":"Attendance, offer clicks and revenue appear in Analytics, and can be sent to your CRM as tags."},"3471":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#next-steps","content":"Create and schedule a live webinar: set a one-time or recurring schedule and choose free or paid registration."},"3472":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#next-steps","content":"Offers and the countdown timer: build the offers you sell during the webinar, with an optional countdown."},"3473":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#next-steps","content":"Charge for webinar registration: take payment through Stripe when people register."},"3474":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"page","content":"The green room and backstage","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","The live room"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room"},"3475":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","content":"How EasyWebinar's green room lets you prepare a live webinar with nothing broadcast, and how backstage holds co-presenters and moderators until you bring them on stage."},"3476":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-1","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":