deo?"},"3834":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#related","content":"Related"},"3835":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","content":"Use the **Library** to find and manage everything your webinars play or display: videos you uploaded or imported, recordings of sessions you have already run, images for your pages, and documents. When you're done, you'll know where each item lives, whether it is using your storage allowance, and how to put a video or recording to work in a simulive or evergreen webinar."},"3836":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                                 |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Where it is** | **Library** in the main sidebar |","table":"table-0"},"3837":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#at-a-glance","content":"|          |                                                      |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Tabs** | **Videos**, **Recordings**, **Images** and **Files** |","table":"table-0"},"3838":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                             |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Adding media** | **Add Media**, with **Local import** or **Import from URL** |","table":"table-0"},"3839":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#at-a-glance","content":"|                         |                                                                     |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where a video lives** | The badge on each card: **EasyWebinar**, or the platform's own logo |","table":"table-0"},"3840":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#at-a-glance","content":"|             |                                                                    |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Storage** | Shown at the top of every tab. Only EasyWebinar-hosted files count |","table":"table-0"},"3841":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                                                                         |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Recordings** | Live sessions land on **Recordings** automatically when recording is on |","table":"table-0"},"3842":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#at-a-glance","content":"|           |                                                                                                |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Reuse** | Pick any video or recording on the **Video Selection** step of a simulive or evergreen webinar |","table":"table-0"},"3843":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#before-you-begin","content":"**Find it in the sidebar.** The Library sits in the main sidebar, alongside **My Webinars**, **Create with AI** and **Integrations**. It isn't inside a single webinar, so anything you add can be reused across your webinars."},"3844":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#before-you-begin","content":"**Know what uses storage.** Only files uploaded to EasyWebinar count towards your storage. Videos imported from a URL use none."},"3845":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#before-you-begin","content":"**Keep live recording on** if you want your sessions to land here. Recording is on by default in the live room, where the header reads **Auto Recording Enabled**."},"3846":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#before-you-begin","content":"**Know your upload limit.** Upload video as **MP4**, up to **4 GB** per file. See video and storage limits."},"3847":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#open-library","content":"Click **Library** in the sidebar. It has four tabs, and your storage is shown at the top of every one of them."},"3848":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#open-library","content":"| Tab        | What it holds                                                                 |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Videos** | Videos you added yourself, uploaded from your computer or imported from a URL |","table":"table-1"},"3849":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#open-library","content":"| Tab            | What it holds                               |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| **Recordings** | Recordings of webinars you have already run |","table":"table-1"},"3850":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#open-library","content":"| Tab        | What it holds                              |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Images** | Images you uploaded, for use on your pages |","table":"table-1"},"3851":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#open-library","content":"| Tab       | What it holds          |\n| --------- | ---------------------- |\n| **Files** | Documents such as PDFs |","table":"table-1"},"3852":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#videos","content":"Open the **Videos** tab. Each card shows the video's duration and when it was added, with a menu for renaming, previewing or removing it."},"3853":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#videos","content":"*1 The four tabs · 2 Your storage allowance · 3 A YouTube badge · 4 An EasyWebinar badge. Account details and some thumbnails are blurred.*"},"3854":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#videos","content":"The small badge in the corner of each card shows where the video is hosted:"},"3855":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#videos","content":"| Badge           | What it means                     | Uses your storage? |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| **EasyWebinar** | The file is stored on EasyWebinar | Yes                |","table":"table-2"},"3856":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#videos","content":"| Badge                        | What it means                                         | Uses your storage? |\n| ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| **YouTube**, Vimeo or Wistia | You imported a link; the video stays on that platform | No                 |","table":"table-2"},"3857":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#videos","content":"Check the badge before you delete anything on another platform. Removing a YouTube video breaks the webinar that plays it, while removing an EasyWebinar-hosted video is contained within EasyWebinar."},"3858":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#recordings","content":"Open the **Recordings** tab. Each recording is named after its webinar, with the duration and the date it was recorded."},"3859":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#recordings","content":"*Recordings of sessions already run, each named after its webinar. Account details are blurred.*"},"3860":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#recordings","content":"Recordings are captured automatically when **Auto Recording** is on in the live room, and appear here after the session. They also show on the **Recordings** tab of the video picker when you set up a simulive or evergreen webinar."},"3861":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#images","content":"Open the **Images** tab to see images you've uploaded for your pages. Click **Add Media** to upload more."},"3862":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#files","content":"Open the **Files** tab for documents, such as PDFs. Each file shows its name, its upload date and its page count."},"3863":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#files","content":"The **Files** tab is also where the AI Moderator's documents live. The AI Moderator, available from Pro onward, answers attendee questions from documents you give it, reading **PDF, DOCX or PPTX** files up to **25MB** each, and it retrains every time you add a source."},"3864":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#add-media","content":"Click **Add Media**. It works the same on every tab and offers two routes:"},"3865":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#add-media","content":"| Route            | What happens                                         |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Local import** | Uploads from your computer, and EasyWebinar hosts it |","table":"table-3"},"3866":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#add-media","content":"| Route               | What happens                                                          |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Import from URL** | Points at **YouTube**, **Vimeo**, **Wistia** or a direct **MP4** link |","table":"table-3"},"3867":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#add-media","content":"For an imported video you also enter its length, because EasyWebinar needs the duration to schedule sessions. See Video hosting for both routes step by step."},"3868":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#use-in-webinar","content":"Simulive and evergreen webinars play a video from your library:"},"3869":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#use-in-webinar","content":"When you create the webinar, the **Video Selection** step shows your library, filtered by **All**, **Videos** or **Recordings**."},"3870":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#use-in-webinar","content":"Click the video you want, or use **Add Video** to add a new one without leaving the step."},"3871":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#use-in-webinar","content":"To change it later, open the webinar's **Content** tab and use the **Webinar Video** panel. **Preview** plays the current video and **Change Video** swaps it."},"3872":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#use-in-webinar","content":"Changing the video doesn't affect the webinar's schedule, pages or registrations."},"3873":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#verify","content":"**A new upload** appears on the **Videos** tab with the **EasyWebinar** badge, and your storage figure at the top of the Library goes up."},"3874":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#verify","content":"**An imported video** appears with its platform's badge, and your storage figure doesn't change."},"3875":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#verify","content":"**A live session you recorded** appears on the **Recordings** tab after the session, named after its webinar."},"3876":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#verify","content":"**A new document** appears on the **Files** tab with its name, upload date and page count."},"3877":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#verify","content":"**A library video in use** shows in the **Webinar Video** panel on that webinar's **Content** tab."},"3878":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#what-it-is","content":"The Library is the account-wide store for everything you upload or record. Simulive and evergreen webinars get their content from it, finished live sessions end up in it, and your storage allowance is spent there."},"3879":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#what-it-is","content":"| Question           | Library answer                                                             |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Is it per webinar? | No. It sits in the sidebar, so anything in it can be reused on any webinar |","table":"table-4"},"3880":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#what-it-is","content":"| Question           | Library answer                                            |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| What does it hold? | Videos, recordings of past webinars, images and documents |","table":"table-4"},"3881":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#what-it-is","content":"| Question           | Library answer                                              |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| What uses storage? | Only files uploaded to EasyWebinar. Imported links use none |","table":"table-4"},"3882":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#what-it-is","content":"| Question                     | Library answer                                        |\n| ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| How do recordings get there? | Automatically, after a live session with recording on |","table":"table-4"},"3883":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#what-its-for","content":"The Library is the shared store behind your webinars. It is where simulive and evergreen webinars get their content, and where finished live sessions end up. A video added once can be used by any webinar that needs it."},"3884":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#how-it-helps","content":"**One place for every recording.** Live sessions with recording on land in **Recordings**, with no exporting or uploading."},"3885":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#how-it-helps","content":"**Live sessions become reusable content.** You can pick a recording as the video for a simulive or evergreen webinar."},"3886":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#how-it-helps","content":"**Storage is visible.** The figure at the top of each tab, and the badge on each video, show what uses your allowance."},"3887":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#how-it-helps","content":"**Safer deletions.** The badge tells you whether a video depends on another platform before you remove anything."},"3888":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#without-it","content":"Without a shared library, each recorded webinar needs its video added again. Recordings of live sessions sit apart from the webinars that could reuse them. It also gets harder to see which videos depend on an outside platform."},"3889":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#why-buyers-care","content":"It matters most to teams that run recorded webinars and train or sell with the same content again and again. The question tends to come up once the first few sessions are recorded and someone asks where they all went."},"3890":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#approach","content":"Take a typical case. The operations team at a franchise with 40 bakery outlets runs a live training session each month for new store managers. It covers opening checks, food safety and the till system. Managers who join later need the same training, usually in their first week."},"3891":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#approach","content":"The usual workaround is to download the recording from a meeting tool, upload it to a shared drive and email the link around. That can work, but copies end up in several places and nobody is quite sure which one is current. A link held in one person's account may stop working when they leave."},"3892":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#approach","content":"What changed is that the training became a standing library rather than a one-off event. New managers start every month, so the recordings have to be easy to find and reuse, not just stored somewhere."},"3893":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#approach","content":"EasyWebinar keeps recordings, uploads and documents in one Library for the whole account. EasyWebinar saves each recorded live session to the **Recordings** tab, named after its webinar, with its duration and date. The team can then pick that recording as the video for an evergreen webinar, so each new manager registers and watches in their first week."},"3894":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#approach","content":"One fact is easy to check. Start a simulive or evergreen webinar, and the **Video Selection** step lists your past live sessions under **Recordings**. That reuse is one of the capabilities covered in How the Library compares, below."},"3895":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-video-hosting","content":"**Add Media** is where you choose between hosting a video on EasyWebinar and importing it from YouTube, Vimeo, Wistia or a direct MP4 link. The choice decides whether the video uses your storage. See Video hosting."},"3896":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-live-room","content":"The live room's header shows **Auto Recording Enabled** when recording is on, and the badge changes to **Recording** once you're live. Recording can be changed under **Settings → Recording Settings**, and recorded sessions land in **Library → Recordings**. See Run a live webinar."},"3897":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-cloning","content":"A webinar's type can't be changed, so the route from live to automated is cloning. Clone the live webinar, choose **Evergreen** for the copy, and pick the live session's recording on the new webinar's **Content** tab. The recording is already in your library. See Clone a webinar."},"3898":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-recorded-webinars","content":"Both types play a recording, and both choose it from the library on the **Video Selection** step. See Create a simulive webinar and Create an evergreen webinar."},"3899":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-plan","content":"Under **Settings** → **Manage Plan**, the **Plan** tab has a **Storage** meter for space used by your videos and recordings, with **Buy More**, and the **Add-ons** tab offers **Additional Storage (5GB)**. Both are covered in Your plan, billing and add-ons."},"3900":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-ai-moderator","content":"The AI Moderator's knowledge base documents live on the **Files** tab. Because the moderator retrains with each new source, give it a moment after an upload before you test it."},"3901":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the Library fits different kinds of work."},"3902":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#course-creators","content":"A creator runs a launch webinar live with recording on. Afterwards, the session sits in **Recordings**, and the creator clones the webinar as evergreen and picks that recording, so the version that sold well live keeps running. See selling online courses with webinars."},"3903":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#product-teams","content":"A product team uploads its demo with **Local import** rather than publishing it on YouTube, so the video stays private to the webinar. The **EasyWebinar** badge confirms where it is hosted, and the storage meter shows the space it takes."},"3904":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#agencies","content":"An agency managing webinars that play videos from a client's YouTube channel checks the badges on the **Videos** tab before the client tidies up their channel, because removing a YouTube video breaks the webinar that plays it."},"3905":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#customer-success","content":"A customer success team keeps its product FAQ and onboarding guides on the **Files** tab as the AI Moderator's knowledge base (from Pro onward), so questions on an unattended evergreen onboarding webinar can be answered from the team's own documents."},"3906":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#compare","content":"EasyWebinar records your live sessions into the same Library that holds your uploads and imported links. Any of those recordings can then become the video for a simulive or evergreen webinar."},"3907":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#compare","content":"Library and recording features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"3908":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#compare","content":"| Platform        | Live sessions recorded automatically | Recordings reused as an automated webinar's video | Uploads and imported links in one library |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                                  | Yes                                               | Yes                                       |","table":"table-5"},"3909":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#compare","content":"| Platform  | Live sessions recorded automatically | Recordings reused as an automated webinar's video | Uploads and imported links in one library |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Yes (detail)                         | Yes (detail)                                      | Not in docs                               |","table":"table-5"},"3910":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#compare","content":"| Platform       | Live sessions recorded automatically | Recordings reused as an automated webinar's video | Uploads and imported links in one library |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarKit** | Yes (live webinars)                  | Yes (detail)                                      | Partly (uploads depend on plan)           |","table":"table-5"},"3911":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#compare","content":"| Platform     | Live sessions recorded automatically | Recordings reused as an automated webinar's video | Uploads and imported links in one library |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **eWebinar** | Not in docs                          | Partly (Zoom cloud recordings)                    | Yes (detail)                              |","table":"table-5"},"3912":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#compare","content":"| Platform         | Live sessions recorded automatically | Recordings reused as an automated webinar's video | Uploads and imported links in one library |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarNinja** | Yes (detail)                         | Yes (detail)                                      | Partly (only YouTube documented)          |","table":"table-5"},"3913":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"3914":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#compare-stronger","content":"**Recordings sit next to your videos.** In EasyWebinar, **Recordings** is a Library tab beside **Videos**, and it appears in the video picker too. Demio's help centre sends you to the **Schedule** page, filtered to **All Past**, to reach recordings. See EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"3915":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#compare-stronger","content":"**Your own live sessions, kept.** EasyWebinar saves recordings of your live webinars straight into the Library. eWebinar imports cloud recordings from a connected Zoom account, and notes that Zoom only surfaces recordings under a month old. See EasyWebinar vs eWebinar."},"3916":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#compare-stronger","content":"**Larger uploads.** EasyWebinar takes video uploads up to **4 GB** per file. WebinarNinja's help centre lists a 2 GB limit for its video files. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarNinja."},"3917":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#compare-stronger","content":"**Uploads and links side by side.** **Add Media** offers **Local import** and **Import from URL** on every tab. WebinarKit says direct uploads apply if your plan includes them. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarKit."},"3918":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"3919":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**Only EasyWebinar-hosted files count towards storage.** Imported URLs use none."},"3920":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**Upload video as MP4, up to 4 GB.** The **Video Selection** screen lists MP4, MOV or WebM, but the **Upload media** dialog says it supports MP4 files only, so upload MP4 to be safe."},"3921":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**More storage is an add-on.** **Additional Storage (5GB)**, or **Buy More** beside the storage meter."},"3922":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**Recordings appear only if recording was on.** Recording is on by default; check the room header before you go live."},"3923":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**Don't delete a video a webinar is using.** The webinar plays it."},"3924":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**Removing a video on YouTube, Vimeo or Wistia** breaks any webinar that plays the imported link."},"3925":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**AI Moderator documents** are PDF, DOCX or PPTX, up to 25MB each, and the AI Moderator is available from Pro onward."},"3926":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-recordings","content":"On the **Recordings** tab of the **Library**. Each is named after its webinar, with its duration and recording date."},"3927":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-missing-recording","content":"Recordings are captured when **Auto Recording** is on in the live room. If the header didn't read **Auto Recording Enabled**, the session wasn't recorded."},"3928":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-badge","content":"By the badge on its card: **EasyWebinar**, or the platform's own logo."},"3929":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-imported-storage","content":"No. Only files uploaded to EasyWebinar count towards your storage."},"3930":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-storage","content":"It's shown at the top of every Library tab. More is available with the **Additional Storage (5GB)** add-on or **Buy More**."},"3931":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-recording-evergreen","content":"Yes. Pick it from the **Recordings** tab when choosing the video, or swap it in later from the **Webinar Video** panel."},"3932":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-delete","content":"You shouldn't. The webinar plays that video, so removing it leaves the webinar without its content."},"3933":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-documents","content":"On the **Files** tab. It's also where the AI Moderator (from Pro onward) keeps the documents it answers from."},"3934":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-ai-moderator-files","content":"**PDF, DOCX or PPTX**, up to **25MB** per file. The AI Moderator is available from Pro onward."},"3935":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-rename","content":"Yes. Each video card has a menu for renaming, previewing or removing it."},"3936":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#related","content":"Clone a webinar: the route from a live recording in the Library to an evergreen webinar."},"3937":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-148","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#related","content":"Replay pages: another place a recorded session is watched after the event."},"3938":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-149","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#related","content":"Webinars overview: which webinar types play a video from the Library."},"3939":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-150","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#related","content":"Limits and defaults: the Additional Storage add-on alongside the others."},"3940":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","type":"page","content":"Replay pages","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","Videos, recordings and replays"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages"},"3941":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","content":"Turn on a webinar's replay page, decide how long it stays available, send viewers somewhere when it ends, choose between Webinar Replica and Custom Build, and tell a replay apart from instant replay."},"3942":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-1","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"