n","content":"Do reminders work on recurring and evergreen webinars?"},"4429":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-36","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-edit","content":"Can I change what a reminder says?"},"4430":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-37","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-measure","content":"How do I know if my reminders are working?"},"4431":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-38","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-sms-whatsapp","content":"Can I send reminders by text or WhatsApp?"},"4432":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-test","content":"Should I test a text or WhatsApp reminder first?"},"4433":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-ai","content":"Does a webinar built with AI include reminders?"},"4434":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-no-shows","content":"What about people who still didn't turn up?"},"4435":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-crm","content":"Can I send reminders from my CRM instead?"},"4436":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#related","content":"Related"},"4437":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","content":"**Webinar Reminders** are the emails EasyWebinar sends to registrants before the session starts. Each reminder has its own timing, set as a length of time before the webinar, so the same reminders work for a one-off session, a recurring schedule or an evergreen webinar. You can add as many as you need from the **Notifications** tab, and Analytics shows whether they are working: the gap between people who registered and people who attended is the reminders' job."},"4438":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                              |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Emails registrants before the webinar starts |","table":"table-0"},"4439":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |             |\n| ------------------- | ----------- |\n| **Who receives it** | Registrants |","table":"table-0"},"4440":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                       |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How timing works** | Set as time before the webinar, for example *1h 0m 0s before webinar* |","table":"table-0"},"4441":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|              |                                                                   |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How many** | As many as you add with **Create New**; three is a common pattern |","table":"table-0"},"4442":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                         |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Suggested pattern** | A day before, an hour before and fifteen minutes before |","table":"table-0"},"4443":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                  |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you set it** | Webinar → **Notifications** → **Emails** → **Webinar Reminders** |","table":"table-0"},"4444":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                                         |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Schedules** | Works for recurring and evergreen schedules, because timing is relative |","table":"table-0"},"4445":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                                  |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Other channels** | **Reminder SMS** and WhatsApp **Reminder Message**, both in Beta |","table":"table-0"},"4446":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                       |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How to measure it** | **Registered** to attended in the webinar's Analytics |","table":"table-0"},"4447":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#what-it-is","content":"A reminder is an email in the **Webinar Reminders** group on the **Notifications** tab. It goes to people who registered, before the webinar starts, and its purpose is to turn a registration into an attendance."},"4448":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#what-it-is","content":"What makes EasyWebinar's reminders work across webinar types is how their timing is set. A reminder isn't scheduled for a clock time like \"Tuesday at 9am\". It is set relative to the session, expressed as hours, minutes and seconds before the webinar, such as *0h 15m 0s before webinar*. A daily recurring webinar or an evergreen webinar has many sessions, and relative timing is why the same reminders work across all of them."},"4449":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#what-it-is","content":"Reminders sit between two other email groups. The **Registration Confirmation** goes out the moment someone signs up, and **Webinar Follow-ups** go out after the session. Reminders cover the time in between, which is when most registrants forget."},"4450":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#what-its-for","content":"Getting people to register is the easy part; getting them to turn up is what notifications are for. Reminders bring the date, the time and the way in back to each registrant. They land the day before, when people can still plan, and in the final minutes, when they need a nudge to click."},"4451":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#how-it-helps","content":"**It brings the session back into view.** A sign-up from days ago is easy to forget. A reminder an hour before puts it in front of the person again."},"4452":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#how-it-helps","content":"**The last reminder does most of the work.** In EasyWebinar's guidance, the one fifteen minutes before matters most."},"4453":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#how-it-helps","content":"**It runs on every session by itself.** Timing is relative, so nothing needs rescheduling when new sessions appear."},"4454":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#how-it-helps","content":"**It is measurable.** **Registered** to attended in Analytics shows whether the reminders are working."},"4455":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#without-it","content":"Without reminders, attendance depends on people remembering a session they booked days or weeks ago. Analytics shows the cost as a large **Missed** count: people who registered and never came. EasyWebinar reads a low registered-to-attended rate as a notification problem, not a content one."},"4456":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#why-buyers-care","content":"Every result that matters to the business, from offer clicks to booked calls, depends on people actually watching. That makes reminders matter most to teams that sell or book calls at the end of a session. It matters even more on automated webinars, where sessions run without anyone checking the emails."},"4457":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#approach","content":"Take a typical case. A yoga teacher-training school runs a free evergreen info session for people thinking about its 200-hour course. The session plays several times a week, and people register from the school's Instagram. Most sign up on their phones, often days before the session they pick."},"4458":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#approach","content":"A common approach is to schedule reminder emails by hand for each session date. That may work for one session a month, but it gets hard with several a week. Gaps creep in, and some people may hear nothing between signing up and the start."},"4459":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#approach","content":"The reminders themselves don't change from one session to the next. What changes is the start time each one counts back from. A reminder set against the session, rather than the calendar, fits every session the schedule creates."},"4460":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#approach","content":"EasyWebinar sets each reminder as time before the webinar, on the **Notifications** tab. The school keeps three: a day, an hour and fifteen minutes before. Each one follows every session on the evergreen schedule. For the final nudge, the school adds a **Reminder SMS**, in Beta, because its audience reads texts quickly."},"4461":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#approach","content":"The screenshot under Find your reminders shows the **Webinar Reminders** group with reminders timed 15 minutes, 1 hour and 24 hours before the webinar. How other platforms set reminder timing and channels is covered in How reminder emails compare, below."},"4462":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#find-reminders","content":"Open your webinar and click the **Notifications** tab."},"4463":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#find-reminders","content":"Stay on the **Emails** channel and find the **Webinar Reminders** group."},"4464":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#find-reminders","content":"*1 Channel tabs · 2 Email Settings · 3 An email group · 4 Create New.*"},"4465":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#find-reminders","content":"Each entry shows its **trigger**, the audience it goes **to**, and its **subject**, so the group reads as a timeline of what registrants will receive."},"4466":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#edit-reminder","content":"Open the reminder you want to change."},"4467":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#edit-reminder","content":"Change its subject, content and timing."},"4468":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#edit-reminder","content":"Set the timing as time before the webinar, in hours, minutes and seconds."},"4469":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#edit-reminder","content":"Save your changes."},"4470":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#add-reminder","content":"Click **Create New** in the **Webinar Reminders** group."},"4471":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#add-reminder","content":"Set its timing before the webinar."},"4472":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#add-reminder","content":"Write the subject and content."},"4473":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#sensible-schedule","content":"| Reminder     | Timing before the webinar  | What it's for                                 |\n| ------------ | -------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| A day before | One day before the session | Lets people plan their day around the session |","table":"table-1"},"4474":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#sensible-schedule","content":"| Reminder       | Timing before the webinar | What it's for                                                       |\n| -------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| An hour before | *1h 0m 0s before webinar* | Brings the session back to mind while there's still time to prepare |","table":"table-1"},"4475":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#sensible-schedule","content":"| Reminder               | Timing before the webinar  | What it's for                                              |\n| ---------------------- | -------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Fifteen minutes before | *0h 15m 0s before webinar* | The prompt to join now; the one that does most of the work |","table":"table-1"},"4476":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#sensible-schedule","content":"Three is a sensible default. Webinars built with **Create with AI** arrive with exactly this pattern already drafted: **Reminder — 1d**, **Reminder — 1h** and **Reminder — 15m**, with merge tags already in place so dates, times and join links fill themselves in."},"4477":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#check-sender","content":"Reminders use the webinar's **Email Settings**: the **Sender name** registrants see and the **Reply-to email** where replies go. Set the sender to a name registrants will recognise from their confirmation."},"4478":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#sms-whatsapp","content":"Both Beta channels have a reminder of their own on the **Notifications** tab: **Reminder SMS** on the **SMS** tab and **Reminder Message** on the **Whatsapp** tab, each sent before the webinar starts. They work alongside email rather than replacing it, and suit the final reminder before a session, when an email may sit unread."},"4479":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#sms-whatsapp","content":"In short:"},"4480":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#sms-whatsapp","content":"**They need a phone number.** Add the **Phone** field to your registration form, or there is nobody to message."},"4481":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#sms-whatsapp","content":"**They come from an EasyWebinar number**, not your own."},"4482":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#sms-whatsapp","content":"**You build them from templates** grouped by tone, then edit the words."},"4483":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#sms-whatsapp","content":"**You can test first.** **Send Test SMS** and **Send Test Message** send the selected template to your own number. Pick your country from the flag dropdown rather than typing a dialling code."},"4484":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#sms-whatsapp","content":"**Keep them short.** A reminder needs the time and the link."},"4485":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#sms-whatsapp","content":"Pick whichever channel your audience actually uses. Sending both tends to irritate people."},"4486":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#with-confirmation","content":"The confirmation starts the sequence and carries the join link; reminders bring the registrant back to it. Both are on the same tab and share the same sender settings."},"4487":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#with-evergreen","content":"An evergreen webinar generates a long run of sessions from one schedule, and can add just-in-time sessions that start shortly after someone registers. Reminders are timed relative to the webinar rather than to a clock, which is why they work for recurring and evergreen schedules without being set session by session."},"4488":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#with-analytics","content":"The webinar's **Analytics** tab shows the funnel from **Visitors** to **Registered**, **Live Attended**, **Total Attended** and **Missed**. Two gaps tell you different things:"},"4489":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#with-analytics","content":"| Gap                            | What a low number means                                          |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Visitors** to **Registered** | A registration page problem: the headline, the form, the promise |","table":"table-2"},"4490":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#with-analytics","content":"| Gap                        | What a low number means                   |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Registered** to attended | A notification problem, not a content one |","table":"table-2"},"4491":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#with-analytics","content":"Change your reminders, run the next session, and compare."},"4492":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#with-follow-ups","content":"**Missed** counts people who registered and never showed up. Add a **Webinar Follow-up** with its audience set to no-shows and include the replay link. In **People**, filter by **Behavior** for no-shows to see exactly who they are, then **Export** the list if you need it elsewhere."},"4493":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#with-crm","content":"If you would rather send reminders from your CRM or email tool, map the **Webinar Join Link** into one of its custom fields. Each contact then holds their own working link, which is what lets your system send the reminder instead of EasyWebinar."},"4494":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#with-cloning","content":"**Email notifications** can come across when you clone a webinar, so a reminder schedule you have tuned carries into the copy."},"4495":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how reminders fit different kinds of webinar."},"4496":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#product-teams","content":"A product team runs a weekly live demo. The three-reminder pattern goes out before every session without anyone touching it, and the team watches **Registered** to attended week by week to see whether a subject-line change made a difference."},"4497":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#course-creators","content":"A creator's evergreen webinar runs daily. Because reminder timing is relative to the webinar, the same three emails serve the whole schedule. The creator adds a Beta **Reminder SMS** as the final nudge for an audience that reads texts faster than email. See selling online courses with webinars."},"4498":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#customer-success","content":"A customer success team runs onboarding webinars for new customers. Their reminders restate what to have ready before the session, and the fifteen-minute reminder carries the link and nothing else."},"4499":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team already runs its nurture emails from its own system, so it maps the **Webinar Join Link** into a CRM field and sends one of the reminders from there, keeping EasyWebinar's reminders for the final hour."},"4500":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#compare","content":"EasyWebinar lets you time each reminder in hours, minutes and seconds before the session. You can also add a reminder by text or by WhatsApp, both in Beta. More registrants attend when the reminder arrives at the moment you chose."},"4501":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#compare","content":"Reminder features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"4502":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#compare","content":"| Platform        | Reminder timing you choose | SMS reminder (Beta) | WhatsApp reminder (Beta) |\n| --------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                        | Yes                 | Yes                      |","table":"table-3"},"4503":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#compare","content":"| Platform                       | Reminder timing you choose | SMS reminder (Beta) | WhatsApp reminder (Beta) |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **WebinarJam and EverWebinar** | Yes (detail)               | Yes (detail)        | Not in docs              |","table":"table-3"},"4504":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#compare","content":"| Platform       | Reminder timing you choose               | SMS reminder (Beta) | WhatsApp reminder (Beta) |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **WebinarKit** | Partly (1 day and 30 minutes by default) | Yes (detail)        | Not in docs              |","table":"table-3"},"4505":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#compare","content":"| Platform      | Reminder timing you choose              | SMS reminder (Beta) | WhatsApp reminder (Beta) |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **Livestorm** | Partly (1 hour and 24 hours by default) | Not in docs         | Not in docs              |","table":"table-3"},"4506":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#compare","content":"| Platform | Reminder timing you choose       | SMS reminder (Beta) | WhatsApp reminder (Beta) |\n| -------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **Zoom** | Partly (1 hour, 1 day or 1 week) | Not in docs         | Not in docs              |","table":"table-3"},"4507":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"4508":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#compare-stronger","content":"**Timing to the minute.** EasyWebinar takes timings such as *0h 15m 0s before webinar*. Zoom's reminder email offers 1 hour, 1 day or 1 week before the start, as EasyWebinar vs Zoom shows."},"4509":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#compare-stronger","content":"**As many reminders as your schedule needs.** EasyWebinar adds another reminder with **Create New**. Livestorm documents two reminders by default, one hour and 24 hours before, covered in EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"4510":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#compare-stronger","content":"**WhatsApp for the final nudge.** EasyWebinar's Beta **Reminder Message** on the **Whatsapp** tab sends before the webinar starts. WebinarJam's reminders run by email, SMS or voice call, as EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar sets out."},"4511":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"4512":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#limits","content":"**Timing is relative to the webinar**, not a fixed clock time. Set it in hours, minutes and seconds before the session."},"4513":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#limits","content":"**Reminders are set per webinar.** Use cloning to carry a schedule to a new webinar."},"4514":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#limits","content":"**Reminders go to registrants.** They are written once per webinar and sent to the people who registered for it."},"4515":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#limits","content":"**SMS and WhatsApp reminders are in Beta** and only reach people who gave a phone number on your registration form."},"4516":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#limits","content":"**SMS and WhatsApp come from an EasyWebinar number**, so replies don't reach your phone."},"4517":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#limits","content":"**Email stays the main channel.** Text and WhatsApp reminders work alongside email, not instead of it."},"4518":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-how-many","content":"Three is a sensible default: a day before, an hour before, and fifteen minutes before. The last one does most of the work."},"4519":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-add-more","content":"Yes. Click **Create New** in the **Webinar Reminders** group, and set the timing for each."},"4520":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-timing","content":"As time before the webinar, in hours, minutes and seconds, for example *1h 0m 0s before webinar*."},"4521":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-evergreen","content":"Yes. Timing is relative to the webinar, not a fixed clock time, so it works for recurring and evergreen schedules."},"4522":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-edit","content":"Yes. Open the reminder to change its subject, content and timing."},"4523":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-measure","content":"Compare **Registered** with attendance in the webinar's Analytics. A low registered-to-attended rate points to your notifications, not your content."},"4524":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-sms-whatsapp","content":"Both are in Beta. **Reminder SMS** and the WhatsApp **Reminder Message** send before the webinar starts, and both need the **Phone** field on your registration form."},"4525":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-test","content":"Yes. **Send Test SMS** and **Send Test Message** send the selected template to your own number so you see exactly what registrants receive."},"4526":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-ai","content":"Yes. **Create with AI** drafts reminders for a day, an hour and fifteen minutes before, with merge tags for dates, times and join links."},"4527":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-no-shows","content":"Add a **Webinar Follow-up** with its audience set to no-shows and include the replay link."},"4528":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#faq-crm","content":"Yes. Map the **Webinar Join Link** into a custom field in your CRM so each contact has their own working link."},"4529":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#related","content":"Registration confirmation emails: the first email in the sequence, carrying the join link your reminders point back to."},"4530":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#related","content":"Webinar analytics: read Registered against attended to judge your reminders."},"4531":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#related","content":"Replay pages: the page to send no-shows the reminders didn't reach."},"4532":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#related","content":"Create an evergreen webinar: the schedule where relative timing saves the most work."},"4533":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails#related","content":"Create a webinar with AI: starts you wit