orm block in the page builder and you can add a **Phone** field, add your own custom fields, turn on a **GDPR Compliance** consent checkbox, and turn on **UTM Params** so each registration records the campaign that brought it in. What you collect then shows up in the **People** view and can be mapped into a connected CRM."},"4711":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                                   |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you set it** | Webinar → **Content** → **Edit** on **Registration Page** → select the form block |","table":"table-0"},"4712":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                            |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Default fields** | **Full name** and **Email**, both required |","table":"table-0"},"4713":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                         |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Extra fields** | A **Phone** field, and your own custom fields with **Add Custom Field** |","table":"table-0"},"4714":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-45","page_id":"/product