inars/registration/sharing-links#faq-shorten","content":"Yes. Turn on **Shorten URL's** in the Share dialog."},"5246":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-replay-link","content":"In the Share dialog, as **Attendee Replay link**, and on the **Replay** tab as **Replay Page Link**. Turn on **Enable replay page** first."},"5247":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-replay-access","content":"Anyone with the link, while the replay page is enabled."},"5248":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-crm-join-link","content":"Yes. Map **Webinar Join Link** to a custom field in your CRM on the integration's **Custom fields** tab."},"5249":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-own-domain","content":"Yes, with the **C-Name** add-on and a CNAME record at your DNS provider."},"5250":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#related","content":"The Overview tab: where the **Share** button sits, next to **Registration Page**."},"5251":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#related","content