:"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-add-on","content":"Which plan do I need?"},"5298":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-payouts","content":"When do I get the money?"},"5299":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-replay-bundle","content":"Can I sell access to the replay as well?"},"5300":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-currency","content":"What currency are prices in?"},"5301":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-payment-methods","content":"How can attendees pay?"},"5302":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-change-price","content":"Can I change the price later?"},"5303":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-abandoned","content":"Is someone registered if they close checkout without paying?"},"5304":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-who-paid","content":"Where can I see who has paid?"},"5305":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-recorded","content":"Can I charge for an evergreen or simulive webinar?"},"5306":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-offers-in-paid","content":"Can I sell something else during a paid webinar?"},"5307":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-after-paying","content":"What do attendees get after paying?"},"5308":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-convert","content":"Can I make a free webinar paid later?"},"5309":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#related","content":"Related"},"5310":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","content":"A paid webinar asks people to pay before they are registered. In EasyWebinar you choose **Paid** when you create the webinar, set a price, and attendees pay through a Stripe checkout on their way to registering. The money goes straight to your own Stripe account, and every payment appears in the webinar's Overview and Analytics. Paid registration launched in **March 2026**."},"5311":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                             |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Charges attendees to register for a webinar |","table":"table-0"},"5312":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                                   |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar types** | Live, simulive and evergreen; each has the same **Free** or **Paid** pricing step |","table":"table-0"},"5313":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                 |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What you need** | The **Growth** plan or above and a connected **Stripe** account |","table":"table-0"},"5314":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                           |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Price options** | One price, or a second **Live + Replay bundle** option with its own price |","table":"table-0"},"5315":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#at-a-glance","content":"|              |                                                                                  |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Currency** | Set in US dollars; Stripe may show attendees outside the US their local currency |","table":"table-0"},"5316":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                                |\n| --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How attendees pay** | Stripe checkout, by card, or Apple Pay or Link where available |","table":"table-0"},"5317":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                                     |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where the money goes** | Directly to your Stripe account; EasyWebinar never holds your funds |","table":"table-0"},"5318":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#at-a-glance","content":"|                           |                                                                                     |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you see results** | **Overview** (registrants, revenue) and **Analytics → Revenue** (every transaction) |","table":"table-0"},"5319":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |            |\n| ------------------- | ---------- |\n| **Available since** | March 2026 |","table":"table-0"},"5320":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#what-it-is","content":"Paid registration makes payment part of signing up. Instead of a free form that registers someone straight away, the registration page shows your price, the **Register Now** button opens a checkout, and the person is registered only once payment succeeds."},"5321":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#what-it-is","content":"It is different from **selling an offer during a webinar**:"},"5322":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#what-it-is","content":"|                  | Paid registration            | Selling an offer in the webinar                              |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **What is sold** | Access to the webinar itself | Something separate: a course, a programme, a call, a product |","table":"table-1"},"5323":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#what-it-is","content":"|                          | Paid registration                   | Selling an offer in the webinar |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **When payment happens** | Before the session, at registration | During or after the session     |","table":"table-1"},"5324":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#what-it-is","content":"|              | Paid registration    | Selling an offer in the webinar |\n| ------------ | -------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Who pays** | Everyone who attends | Only those who buy              |","table":"table-1"},"5325":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#what-it-is","content":"|                       | Paid registration                                | Selling an offer in the webinar |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| **Where it's set up** | The **Pricing** step when you create the webinar | An offer on the **CTAs** tab    |","table":"table-1"},"5326":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#what-it-is","content":"|                         | Paid registration                      | Selling an offer in the webinar      |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Where revenue shows** | **Analytics → Revenue → Paid Webinar** | **Analytics → Revenue → Paid Offer** |","table":"table-1"},"5327":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#what-it-is","content":"A webinar can do both: charge for entry and sell a follow-on offer inside. EasyWebinar reports the two separately under **Revenue by Source**."},"5328":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#what-its-for","content":"Paid registration is for webinars that are the product: workshops, masterclasses, paid trainings and ticketed seminars. People pay to attend, so the seat itself is what you sell."},"5329":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#how-it-helps","content":"**The session earns in its own right.** Every attendee has bought a seat, so the webinar brings in money before it starts."},"5330":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#how-it-helps","content":"**Payouts are yours.** Payments land in your own Stripe account, and Stripe pays out to your bank on its usual schedule. EasyWebinar never holds your funds."},"5331":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#how-it-helps","content":"**The recording can be sold too.** A **Live + Replay bundle** gives buyers a further choice that includes the recording, priced separately."},"5332":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#how-it-helps","content":"**Ticket income is kept apart.** **Revenue by Source** separates paid registrations from offers sold in the room."},"5333":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#without-it","content":"Without paid registration, the registration page signs up anyone for nothing. A workshop worth paying for becomes a free session. Its value then has to be won back later, through an offer that only some attendees buy."},"5334":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#why-buyers-care","content":"Paid registration matters most to educators, coaches and consultants whose sessions should earn money rather than cost it. It matters at the planning stage, when a session is designed to be sold rather than given away."},"5335":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#approach","content":"Picture a typical case. A pricing consultant sells tickets to a live, two-hour masterclass for SaaS founders, with seats on sale three weeks ahead. Every founder who buys needs a seat and a join link before the day. Nobody who hasn't paid should get in."},"5336":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#approach","content":"A common approach is to sell tickets on a separate payment page, then add each buyer to the webinar's attendee list manually. The day before, someone checks the payment list against the sign-up list. A buyer missed in the copying never gets a join link, and the consultant finds out only when that founder emails at the start time."},"5337":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#approach","content":"If paying and registering happen in one step, there is nothing to copy. The seat is what the consultant sells, so buying it can create the registration. The list of buyers and the list of registrants then become the same list."},"5338":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#approach","content":"EasyWebinar makes checkout the final step of signing up. The consultant chooses **Paid** on the pricing step while creating the webinar, and **Register Now** on the registration page then opens a Stripe checkout. EasyWebinar registers a founder only once their payment goes through. It then sends them to the thank-you page, which shows their personal join link."},"5339":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#approach","content":"In the Revenue screenshot below, the **Paid Webinar** view splits registration payments into completed, pending and abandoned checkouts. A founder who closes the checkout without paying is counted under **Checkout abandoned** and is never added as a registrant. How other tools take payment is covered in How paid webinars compare, further down."},"5340":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#before-you-begin","content":"**Be on Growth or above.** Built-in checkout and paid webinars start at Growth."},"5341":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#before-you-begin","content":"**Connect a Stripe account.** Payments run through Stripe. You can connect it during the pricing step or from **Integrations → Payment**."},"5342":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#before-you-begin","content":"**Choose Paid when you create the webinar.** The price block is added to your registration page at creation. See Choose Paid at creation below."},"5343":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#set-your-price","content":"Create a webinar as usual: **My Webinars → Create a Webinar → Create Manually**, name it and choose a type. On **Step 3 of 4: Pricing**, choose **Paid**."},"5344":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#set-your-price","content":"|     | Setting  | What to do                   |\n| --- | -------- | ---------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Paid** | Charge attendees to register |","table":"table-2"},"5345":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#set-your-price","content":"|     | Setting                               | What to do                                                                                                          |\n| --- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Pricing title** and **description** | What the attendee is buying, for example \"General Admission\". Both appear on your registration page and at checkout |","table":"table-2"},"5346":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#set-your-price","content":"|     | Setting                | What to do              |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| 3   | **Live webinar price** | The price in US dollars |","table":"table-2"},"5347":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#set-your-price","content":"|     | Setting      | What to do                                                                  |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Payments** | The Stripe account that receives the money. Shows **connected** once linked |","table":"table-2"},"5348":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#set-your-price","content":"|     | Setting                  | What to do                                                                             |\n| --- | ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 5   | **Live + Replay bundle** | Turn on to sell a second option that includes the replay recording, with its own price |","table":"table-2"},"5349":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#set-your-price","content":"If Stripe isn't connected yet, a **Payments · Action required** panel appears with **Connect with Stripe**."},"5350":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#set-your-price","content":"Continue to choose a registration template and click **Create Webinar**. The template you pick includes the price automatically. You can switch back to **Free** at any point before creating the webinar."},"5351":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#pricing-recorded-webinars","content":"Simulive and evergreen webinars have the same **Free** or **Paid** choice. On those types, the pricing step comes after the schedule and before **Continue to Video Selection**, where you pick the recording the sessions will play."},"5352":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#live-replay-bundle","content":"Turn on **Live + Replay bundle** to offer two choices on the registration page: the live webinar alone, or the webinar plus its recording, each at its own price. It suits people who want to attend but also keep the session to watch again, and people who can't make the live time."},"5353":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#live-replay-bundle","content":"If you sell replay access, set how long the replay stays open on the **Replay** tab: **Always Available**, **Expire after days** or a **Specific date**. Make sure the bundle's description matches that setting."},"5354":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#registration-page","content":"The registration page shows the price above the form."},"5355":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#registration-page","content":"|     | Area             | What it does                                                                                                                    |\n| --- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Price option** | The pricing title, description and price, selected by default. With a Live + Replay bundle there are two options to choose from |","table":"table-3"},"5356":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#registration-page","content":"|     | Area             | What it does                                                             |\n| --- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 2   | **Register Now** | Takes the attendee to checkout instead of registering them straight away |","table":"table-3"},"5357":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#checkout","content":"The attendee lands on a Stripe checkout page showing your business name and the webinar as the item. They can pay by card, or by Apple Pay or Link where available. Their email is carried over from the registration form, so they don't type it twice."},"5358":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#checkout","content":"Attendees outside the US may be offered the price in their own currency alongside the dollar price. Stripe handles the conversion."},"5359":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#confirmation-and-calendar","content":"Once payment goes through, the attendee is registered and sent to your thank-you page."},"5360":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#confirmation-and-calendar","content":"|     | Area                                    | What it shows                               |\n| --- | --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Webinar join link** and **Join Room** | The attendee's personal link to the webinar |","table":"table-4"},"5361":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#confirmation-and-calendar","content":"|     | Area                             | What it shows                                                            |\n| --- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 2   | **Date** and **Add to Calendar** | The session they booked, with Google, Outlook and Apple calendar buttons |","table":"table-4"},"5362":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#confirmation-and-calendar","content":"They also receive your **Registration Confirmation** email, which carries their join link, and your reminders before the session."},"5363":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#earned-on-overview-tab","content":"|     | Area            | What it shows                        |\n| --- | --------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 1   | **Registrants** | Everyone who has registered and paid |","table":"table-5"},"5364":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#earned-on-overview-tab","content":"|     | Area        | What it shows                |\n| --- | ----------- | ---------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Revenue** | Total taken for this webinar |","table":"table-5"},"5365":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#earned-on-overview-tab","content":"|     | Area                     | What it shows                                       |\n| --- | ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Registration Pricing** | Your pricing title and price. The pencil edits them |","table":"table-5"},"5366":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#earned-on-overview-tab","content":"|     | Area                | What it shows                                                        |\n| --- | ------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Payment Gateway** | The connected Stripe account. **Manage** opens your payment settings |","table":"table-5"},"5367":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#earned-in-analytics","content":"Open the webinar's **Analytics** tab, then **Revenue**."},"5368":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#earned-in-analytics","content":"|     | Area        | What it shows                     |\n| --- | ----------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Revenue** | The revenue view for this webinar |","table":"table-6"},"5369":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#earned-in-analytics","content":"|     | Area                                         | What it shows                                                |\n| --- | -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 2   | **Total Revenue** and **Paid Registrations** | Everything earned, and the part that came from registrations |","table":"table-6"},"5370":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#earned-in-analytics","content":"|     | Area                  | What it shows                                                    |\n| --- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Revenue by Source** | The split between paid registrations and offers sold in the room |","table":"table-6"},"5371":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#earned-in-analytics","content":"|     | Area             | What it shows                                                                                                          |\n| --- | ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Paid Webinar** | Switches the section below to registration payments: completed, pending and abandoned checkouts, and every transaction |","table":"table-6"},"5372":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#earned-in-analytics","content":"The transaction list shows each buyer's name, email, session, registration date, amount and status. You can search it and filter by status."},"5373":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#transaction-statuses","content":"Each transaction shows one of these statuses: **Pending**, **Processing**, **Success**, **Failed**, **Canceled**, **Refunded** or **Partially Refunded**. An attendee is registered once their payment succeeds."},"5374":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#abandoned-checkouts","content":"**Checkout abandoned** counts people who reached checkout but didn't pay. They aren't registered. It is a useful number to watch: a high count points to the price, the checkout step, or a mismatch between the registration page and what checkout shows."},"5375":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#with-offers","content":"A paid webinar can still sell. Add offers on the **CTAs** tab, with an optional price and countdown timer, and offer sales are reported under **Paid Offer**, separately from registration revenue. Buyers of an offer receive the **Paid Offer — Transaction Success** email."},"5376":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#with-replays","content":"With the replay page set to **Webinar Replica**, the recording shows the same video, offers, polls and chat replay as the session. Replay availability is set on the **Replay** tab, and **After the replay ends** under Redirects can send viewers to your next offer."},"5377":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#with-emails","content":"Paid registrants get the same **Registration Confirmation**, **Webinar Reminders** and **Webinar Follow-ups** as everyone else, all set on the **Notifications** tab. Reminders are timed relative to the webinar, so they work for recurring and evergreen schedules too."},"5378":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#with-crm","content":"A connected CRM or email tool can tag paid registrants as they sign up (the **Registered** event), and tag what they did in the session, from **Attended** and **Missed** to **Watched full** and **Clicked offer**. Map the **Webinar Join Link** into a CRM field if you want to send reminders from your own system. See Connect a CRM and map your webinar data."},"5379":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#with-people-view","content":"**People** in the sidebar lists every registrant across your webinars. Filter by webinar, behaviour or source, then **Export** to work with a list of paid attendees elsewhere."},"5380":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#with-create-with-ai","content":"Webinars built with **Create with AI** have the same pricing step and behave like any other once created. Include who the webinar is for and what you are selling in your prompt so the pages and emails it writes fit a paid event, and read the generated copy before you publish, especially around price and what's included."},"5381":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#who-uses-it","content":"These patterns show how paid registration fits different kinds of webinars."},"5382":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#paid-workshops","content":"A coach or educator runs a live, ticketed workshop. The registration page sells a general admission ticket, the **Live + Replay bundle** sells the recording to people who can't attend live, and the confirmation page gives each buyer their join link and calendar buttons."},"5383":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#course-creators","content":"A creator charges a small fee for a live training that previews a full course, then presents the course itself as an offer inside the session. Registration revenue and course sales appear separately under **Revenue by Source**. See selling online courses with webinars."},"5384":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#evergreen-paid","content":"A recorded training is sold on an evergreen schedule, so people pay and watch at a session time that suits them. The same pricing step applies, and every purchase lands in **Analytics → Revenue**."},"5385":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#professional-education","content":"Educators in fields such as real estate, finance or wellness run paid seminars. Paid registration keeps the attendee list limited to people who paid, and the transaction list gives a record of every purchase."},"5386":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#choose-paid-at-creation","content":"The Overview tab has a **Convert to paid** button for free webinars. If you convert an existing free webinar to paid, its registration page keeps the free form, so people can still register without paying. Create a new webinar and choose **Paid** on the pricing step instead."},"5387":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare","content":"EasyWebinar takes payment as part of sign-up: **Register Now** opens a Stripe checkout, and the person is registered once they've paid. It can also sell the replay at its own price, and it lists every payment against the webinar. The sale, the attendee and the data stay in one place."},"5388":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare","content":"Paid registration features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"5389":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare","content":"| Platform        | Pay and register in one step | Replay access sold at its own price | Every payment listed against the webinar |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                          | Yes                                 | Yes                                      |","table":"table-7"},"5390":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare","content":"| Platform                                 | Pay and register in one step | Replay access sold at its own price | Every payment listed against the webinar |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Zoom** (Zoom Events and Webinars Plus) | Yes (detail)                 | Complimentary with the ticket       | Yes (detail)                             |","table":"table-7"},"5391":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare","content":"| Platform                       | Pay and register in one step       | Replay access sold at its own price | Every payment listed against the webinar |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarJam and EverWebinar** | Partly (form to fill after paying) | Not in docs                         | Partly (host-entered fee amount)         |","table":"table-7"},"5392":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare","content":"| Platform      | Pay and register in one step     | Replay access sold at its own price | Every payment listed against the webinar |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Partly (Pages & Hubs pages only) | Not in docs                         | Partly (Paid column per registrant)      |","table":"table-7"},"5393":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare","content":"| Platform         | Pay and register in one step | Replay access sold at its own price | Every payment listed against the webinar |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarNinja** | Yes (detail)                 | Not in docs                         | Not in docs                              |","table":"table-7"},"5394":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare","content":"| Platform  | Pay and register in one step | Replay access sold at its own price | Every payment listed against the webinar |\n| --------- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Via Zapier                   | Not in docs                         | Not in docs                              |","table":"table-7"},"5395":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare","content":"| Platform     | Pay and register in one step | Replay access sold at its own price | Every payment listed against the webinar |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **eWebinar** | Third-party checkout         | Not in docs                         | Not in docs                              |","table":"table-7"},"5396":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"5397":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare-stronger","content":"**One flow, no second form.** EasyWebinar registers the buyer as soon as payment succeeds. WebinarJam and EverWebinar send buyers back to a registration form, and their PayPal guide warns that people aren't registered until they complete it. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar."},"5398":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare-stronger","content":"**A priced replay option.** EasyWebinar's **Live + Replay bundle** sells the recording as a second option with its own price. Zoom's replay access is complimentary viewing included with the ticket. WebinarNinja's help centre says multiple pricing levels aren't supported. See EasyWebinar vs Zoom and EasyWebinar vs WebinarNinja."},"5399":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare-stronger","content":"**Every payment in one list.** EasyWebinar's **Paid Webinar** view lists each transaction with its status. Livestorm's help pages describe a Paid column per registrant, with no revenue total for the event. See EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"5400":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare-stronger","content":"**Native, not a workaround.** Demio's help centre points to a Zapier workflow in place of a native paid webinar feature. EasyWebinar's paid registration is a step in creating the webinar. See EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"5401":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 20 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"5402":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#limits","content":"**Prices are set in US dollars.** Stripe may present a local-currency price to attendees outside the US."},"5403":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#limits","content":"**Stripe is the payment processor** for paid registration."},"5404":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#limits","content":"**Payouts follow Stripe's schedule.** EasyWebinar doesn't hold or pay out funds."},"5405":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-148","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#limits","content":"**An abandoned checkout isn't a registration.** Only a successful payment registers someone."},"5406":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-149","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#limits","content":"**You can change the price later** with the pencil on **Registration Pricing** in the Overview tab."},"5407":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-150","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#limits","content":"**Registration and offer revenue are reported separately**, under **Paid Webinar** and **Paid Offer**."},"5408":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-151","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-payment-provider","content":"Stripe. Connect your Stripe account on the pricing step or from **Integrations → Payment**."},"5409":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-152","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-add-on","content":"Growth or above. Checkout starts at Growth, and charging for a webinar also needs a connected Stripe account. If the paid option isn't behaving as expected, check **Settings → Plan** first."},"5410":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-153","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-payouts","content":"Payments go straight to your Stripe account, and Stripe pays out to your bank on its usual schedule."},"5411":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-154","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-replay-bundle","content":"Yes. Turn on **Live + Replay bundle** on the pricing step and set a second price."},"5412":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-155","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-currency","content":"You set the price in US dollars. Stripe may show attendees outside the US the price in their local currency."},"5413":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-156","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-payment-methods","content":"By card, or by Apple Pay or Link where available, on Stripe's checkout page."},"5414":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-157","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-change-price","content":"Yes. Use the pencil on **Registration Pricing** in the Overview tab."},"5415":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-158","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-abandoned","content":"No. They appear under **Checkout abandoned**, not as a registrant."},"5416":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-159","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-who-paid","content":"**Analytics → Revenue → Paid Webinar** lists every transaction with its status. The Overview tab shows the total registrants and revenue."},"5417":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-160","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-recorded","content":"Yes. Both have the same **Free** or **Paid** pricing step when you create them."},"5418":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-161","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-offers-in-paid","content":"Yes. Add an offer on the **CTAs** tab. Offer sales are reported under **Paid Offer**, separately from registration revenue."},"5419":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-162","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-after-paying","content":"The thank-you page shows their personal join link, a **Join Room** button, the session date and **Add to Calendar** buttons for Google, Outlook and Apple. They also get your confirmation email."},"5420":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-163","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#faq-convert","content":"The Overview tab has a **Convert to paid** button, but the registration page of a converted webinar keeps the free form. Create a new webinar and c