ter someone registers. Each needs the **Phone** field on your registration form."],[4524,"Both are in Beta. **Reminder SMS** and the WhatsApp **Reminder Message** send before the webinar starts, and both need the **Phone** field on your registration form."],[4478,"Both Beta channels have a reminder of their own on the **Notifications** tab: **Reminder SMS** on the **SMS** tab and **Reminder Message** on the **Whatsapp** tab, each sent before the webinar starts. They work alongside email rather than replacing it, and suit the final reminder before a session, when an email may sit unread."],[4345,"Both Beta channels have their own message for the moment of registration: **Welcome SMS** on the **SMS** tab and **Welcome Message** on the **Whatsapp** tab, each sent immediately after someone registers. They need a phone number, so the **Phone** field has to be on your registration form, and they come from an EasyWebinar number rather than your own. Both work alongside email rather than replacing it."],[3411,"Both play a recording. Simulive broadcasts it at times you set, so everyone in a session watches together. Evergreen repeats on a schedule and each registrant picks the session that suits them."],[4868,"Both register people for the same webinar."],[4144,"Both routes start from **Library → Add Media**, or from **Add Video** while you set up a simulive or evergreen webinar. Either way the video lands in your library and can be reused on other webinars."],[3898,"Both types play a recording, and both choose it from the library on the **Video Selection** step. See Create a simulive webinar and Create an evergreen webinar."],[4206,"Both types play a video from your library. Simulive plays it at times you set, so everyone in a session watches together; evergreen runs continuously and lets each registrant pick a time."],[2079,"Bring in a moderator"],[2406,"Bring in a moderator"],[1762,"Build a natural cast"],[149,"Build a webinar with AI"],[3244,"Build an evergreen webinar in