n the **Emails** channel, click **Email Settings**."],[2218,"On the **Engagement** tab, set chat to **Hosts only**, or choose **No Chat**."],[3933,"On the **Files** tab. It's also where the AI Moderator (from Pro onward) keeps the documents it answers from."],[5194,"On the **Overview** tab, click **Share** on the webinar's header, next to **Registration Page**."],[3926,"On the **Recordings** tab of the **Library**. Each is named after its webinar, with its duration and recording date."],[4190,"On the **Video Selection** step, click the video you want."],[957,"On the new webinar's **Content** tab, select the recording of your live session."],[5275,"On the Overview tab"],[4659,"On the schedule step when you set up an evergreen webinar, not on the **Replay** tab."],[1693,"On the schedule step, EasyWebinar shows a message saying attendees will see times in their local time based on the selected timezone. On an evergreen webinar, that's true of just-in-time sessions only. Recurring daily and weekly sessions run at the times you set in the webinar's timezone."],[4617,"On the webinar's **Overview** tab, the options menu on the **Scheduling Options** panel changes the schedule for the whole webinar. The same panel shows the frequency, start date, timezone and the preference you chose."],[3544,"On the webinar's **Overview**, click **Enter Room**."],[4885,"On the webinar's **Overview**, click **Share**."],[1697,"On the webinar's **Overview**, open the **Live** tab in the **Sessions** panel. A session on air appears there marked *Live now*, with **Enter room**."],[1279,"On the webinar's **Replay** tab, under **Replay Page Link**, once **Enable replay page** is on. It's also in the Share dialog as **Attendee Replay link**."],[5069,"On the webinar's **Settings → Tracking Code** sub-tab, you pick a page and paste code into **Header Code**, **Body Code** or **Footer Code**. Tracking code is set per page. The registration page tells your ad platform who was interested; the thank-yo