"Plan usage"],[4558,"Plan usage"],[2354,"Poll features, from each platform's public documentation:"],[2228,"Polls"],[163,"Polls and offers"],[3638,"Polls and offers"],[3744,"Polls and offers are created on the **CTAs** tab and shown from the room. A row's toggle in the CTAs list keeps an offer ready without showing it. Switch on **Countdown timer** in the offer editor to put a countdown on an offer."],[2343,"Polls and offers share the CTAs tab, the same list controls and the same **Published** switch. A poll asked just before an offer can show you how ready the room is."],[3717,"Polls don't fire on their own in a live session, so plan when each poll goes out. Offers reach the room when you push them from the **Offers** panel. The **Question** panel keeps **Active** and **Answered** apart, so you can see at a glance what's still waiting."],[2293,"Polls matter most to coaches, consultants and B2B marketing teams who follow up with attendees after the webinar. For them, an answer given just before the offer is an early sign of who is ready to talk. Course creators use polls in long teaching sessions, where steady engagement keeps people watching to the end."],[1706,"Polls, offers and analytics behave as on any webinar. In **People**, filter by **Webinar → Evergreen** to compare your automated funnel with your live sessions. The People view lists every registrant."],[4556,"Polls, offers and chat"],[2751,"Polls, offers and emails"],[2532,"Polls: ask the room a question of your own instead of waiting for theirs."],[2723,"Polls: the other kind of CTA, often asked just before the pitch."],[2223,"Polls: the other way to hear from the room, including people who never type."],[828,"Prevent it next time"],[4962,"Preview, save and publish"],[5268,"Pricing on simulive and evergreen webinars"],[4616,"Pricing, video selection and templates are covered in Create an evergreen webinar."],[1948,"Product and SaaS teams"],[5290,"Professional education"],[2522,"Public if you want people t