e beside the simulated chat."],[2387,"Questions and answers: the attendees' own questions, in a queue."],[2221,"Questions and answers: the question queue you set beside chat on the same tab."],[1594,"Questions and answers: the setting behind the **Questions & Answers** panel and its **Not Answered Rate**."],[2457,"Questions and conversation do different jobs, so they don't need to share one stream. A greeting needs no reply, while a question needs an owner and a record of whether it was answered. Once questions have their own list, a second person can work through it while the presenter keeps going."],[1533,"Read **Views to Clicks** and **Clicks to Purchases** together. A low views-to-clicks rate means the offer itself isn't landing. A low clicks-to-purchases rate means people want the offer but your checkout or price is stopping them."],[4330,"Read the entry. Each one shows its **trigger**, the audience it goes **to**, and its **subject** line, so you can check what it does without opening it."],[352,"Read the first results"],[1851,"Read through **Preview Simulated Chat**."],[1452,"Read your analytics"],[1293,"Reading the webinar funnel: what each figure counts, and how to tell a page problem from a reminder problem."],[3194,"Recorded webinars also have chat options a live webinar lacks: **Third party** embeds an external chat tool, **No Chat** hides the panel, and the **EW Contact Box** collects attendee questions by email even when chat is off."],[3958,"Recording"],[3860,"Recordings are captured automatically when **Auto Recording** is on in the live room, and appear here after the session. They also show on the **Recordings** tab of the video picker when you set up a simulive or evergreen webinar."],[3927,"Recordings are captured when **Auto Recording** is on in the live room. If the header didn't read **Auto Recording Enabled**, the session wasn't recorded."],[1615,"Recurring Schedule"],[3252,"Recurring Schedule"],[4554,"Recurring Schedule"],[3331,"Recurring se