enerating, then choose a video once the webinar is built."],[2210,"Yes. Set **Who can see messages** to **Hosts only**. Each attendee then talks privately to your team."],[3608,"Yes. Switch **Stream** on for each destination before you click **Go Live**."],[1029,"Yes. Switch on **Countdown timer** in the offer editor. You can also make the replay expire after a number of days or on a set date."],[2866,"Yes. That's live to automated in one switch: clone it with **Evergreen** as the type, then select the live session's recording on the copy's **Content** tab."],[3228,"Yes. The **Recordings** filter on the video step lists recordings of your past webinars."],[133,"Yes. The client gets an email confirmation to set their password and join your workspace, so use an address they read."],[2378,"Yes. The middle of the poll editor previews the poll exactly as attendees will see it, updating as you type."],[2214,"Yes. The recording plays while you and your moderators answer in the chat live."],[4655,"Yes. They're two names for the same evergreen setting."],[4521,"Yes. Timing is relative to the webinar, not a fixed clock time, so it works for recurring and evergreen schedules."],[2716,"Yes. Turn its toggle off in the list, or set **Published** to off in the editor."],[308,"Yes. Turn off any of the five output chips before you click **Generate**."],[4658,"Yes. Turn on **Just-in-time Registration**, **Recurring Schedule** or both alongside it, and the registration page offers each as a choice."],[5411,"Yes. Turn on **Live + Replay bundle** on the pricing step and set a second price."],[4380,"Yes. Turn on **Notify admin** in **Email Settings** and give it an address. It sends a copy of registrations there."],[1739,"Yes. Turn on **On Demand** as well; **Schedule Preferences** then reads **Display Just-in-time & Instant-replay**."],[5245,"Yes. Turn on **Shorten URL's** in the Share dialog."],[2715,"Yes. Turn on the **Countdown timer** toggle when you edit the offer."],[2376,"Yes. Turn the poll's toggle off in the CTAs list, or set **Published** to off in the editor."],[2869,"Yes. Untick **Email notifications** under **What would you like to copy?**"],[4804,"Yes. Use **Add Custom Field** on the form block for anything you need to ask."],[2720,"Yes. Use **Attendee Action Follow-ups**, tag them with the **Clicked offer** event in your CRM, or filter **People** by offer clicks and export the list."],[3233,"Yes. Use **Change Video** in the **Webinar Video** panel on the **Content** tab. Schedule, pages and registrations stay as they are."],[1431,"Yes. Use **Columns**."],[1738,"Yes. Use **Exclude specific time** to keep those hours clear."],[310,"Yes. Use **Regenerate** on the script step. Change the number of slides or the duration first if you want a different result."],[5106,"Yes. Use **Tracking Code** in the builder's **Settings** for this page, or the **Tracking Code** sub-tab on the webinar's **Settings** tab."],[125,"Yes. Use the Co-presenter or Moderator join link from the Share dialog."],[5414,"Yes. Use the pencil on **Registration Pricing** in the Overview tab."],[1281,"Yes. When **Create with AI** builds a webinar, the email sequence includes an instant follow-up and one a day later. Every email stays editable, so you can split the audience and change the wording."],[547,"Yes. When you connect Amazon SES, SendGrid or Mailgun, EasyCRM sends through your account with that company rather than replacing it. So set up the account first, then bring its credentials to the **Configure** step on the **Email provider** tab."],[3775,"Yes. You need a camera to enter, but you can switch **Camera** and **Mic** off in the green room and still go live."],[2444,"You also choose who can see the queue:"],[3681,"You can also click **⋮** on the webinar's card in **My Webinars** and choose **Go Live**, which takes you into the same room."],[4725,"You can also restyle the form's submit button from the same place."],[989,"You can also send each person's join link and replay link into your email tool's custom fields, so reminders can come from your own system."],[1228,"You can also send follow-ups from your own email tool. Map webinar events to tags so it knows what each person did, and create the tags in that tool first."],[2323,"You can build every poll before the webinar and keep some hidden:"],[966,"You can build offers before the webinar and keep them hidden until the moment comes. On a live webinar you push the offer from the **Offers** panel in the room."],[2649,"You can build offers well before the webinar and keep them out of sight:"],[1998,"You can build the offer, countdown included, before the webinar and hold it back:"],[1657,"You can run all three together, and the registration page offers each as a choice."],[1233,"You can send each person's replay link across as well, using the **Webinar Replay Link** field on the custom fields tab. Your email tool then fills it into the template."],[5025,"You can skip this step: until you select a template, the button reads **Skip & Create Webinar**, and you can choose a template later."],[2996,"You can skip this step. The button reads **Skip & Create Webinar** until you select a template, and you can choose one later."],[3707,"You can switch your camera and microphone off with **Camera** and **Mic** and stay live, which suits a session built on slides or a video rather than your face."],[2973,"You can't schedule a session in the past. Earlier dates are greyed out in the picker."],[3437,"You choose a type when you create a webinar. **The type can't be changed afterwards**, so it is worth deciding first."],[922,"You choose the type when you create the webinar, and it can't be changed afterwards."],[315,"You choose: **Soft Pitch**, **Balanced Approach** or **Direct Pitch**."],[5528,"You don't have to add everyone here. The **Share** dialog has a **Co-presenter Join Link** and a **Moderator Join Link for Live room**, and a presenter or moderator can join with a link without having an EasyWebinar account at all."],[4901,"You don't have to choose one. You can use the widget on your own site and the link everywhere else."],[4184,"You don't have to visit the Library first. Simulive and evergreen webinars have a **Video Selection** step, after pricing, where you choose the recording the sessions will play."],[123,"You don't invite; you create their account with **Add user**, including their password, then pass the details to them."],[713,"You don't need EasyCRM to run webinars. It's for managing the people your webinars produce. Registrants reach it by connecting EasyCRM as an integration on a webinar, as on this page, or with **Import from EasyWebinar** on its Leads screen."],[1144,"You don't need to write these in the order they send. This order gets the most important messages finished first."],[429,"You don't need your own domain to send broadcasts, because a single business email address also counts as a sending identity. The choice depends on how much you send and how much setup you can take on now."],[260,"You get complete offers with a title, headline, sub-headline, button text and link. Select the ones you want and click **Save and continue**."],[5020,"You pick the registration page's look on **Step 4 of 4 — Registration Template** when you create a webinar manually."],[3438,"You present in real time at a specific date and time. Chat and Q&A happen as they happen. Choose Live when people come for the interaction: a launch, a workshop, a session where you answer real questions."],[5412,"You set the price in US dollars. Stripe may show attendees outside the US the price in their local currency."],[67,"You set their password and nothing is emailed to them. There is no invitation to accept, so pass the login details on yourself and ask them to change the password once they are in."],[3932,"You shouldn't. The webinar plays that video, so removing it leaves the webinar without its content."],[3469,"You show polls and offers in the room."],